e/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/21/code.py:39:    - 不同杯真正画到非边框上的射线路径互不重叠；后放的杯也不会把自己的边框放到旧的非边框射线上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/21/code.py:40:    - 被前驱射线穿过的杯，会把这些路径单元从 mouth 可放内容集合里剔除，保证输入合法、输出也不含歧义覆盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/21/code.py:43:    - 输出里既能看到边框变色，也能看到射线穿过杯体后继续在后方出现，因此可和“撞到就停止”或“路径完全无障碍”区分开。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/21/code.py:46:    - 只让相邻链路发生交互，避免多条旧射线同时穿过同一新杯。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/21/code.py:49:    - 颜色规则不做数值映射；被撞边框直接变成撞它的那条射线颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/19/code.py:20:#     - D7/0 要求最终只保留所有实际弹射线的紧凑外接矩形。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/19/code.py:21:#     - 二者融合后的真正输出不是“裁掉后的原场景”，而是“仅由弹射线组成的小网格”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/19/code.py:30:#     - 差异 1：原题 `out = g.copy()`，本变体改成 `out = full(bg)`，因为输出语义已变成“只保留弹射线”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/1/code.py:29:#     但真正绘制射线时不使用 spike corner 对应的方向，而是使用固定的颜色编码:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/1/code.py:81:#   - `main()` 假设内容色不与 border 色混用到同一 cup 内；generator 保证每个 cup 双色分离。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/17/code.py:388:def _is_similar_to_protrusions(h: int, w: int, protrusions: list[np.ndarray]) -> bool:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/17/code.py:389:    for prot in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/17/code.py:396:def _generate_different_protrusion_types() -> list[tuple[int, int, int]]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/17/code.py:402:def _add_protrusion_with_shape(piece: np.ndarray, protrusion_type: tuple[int, int, int]) -> tuple[np.ndarray | None, np.ndarray | None]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/17/code.py:406:    prot_h, prot_bottom_w, prot_top_w = protrusion_type\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16b78196/17/code.py:422:    protrusion_shape = np.zeros((prot_h, prot_bottom_w), dtype=np.int8)\n