nap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:8:#    - 原题：每个杯子的 mouth 里只有 1 种内容色，全部内容都沿尾刺方向变成 1 条单色射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:30:#    - 原 solver 只画 1 条尾刺射线；这里必须额外求 mouth 侧锚点并画第 2 条射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:36:#    - 继续采用 output-first：先放杯框和两条目标射线，再回填输入内容。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:38:#    - 尾刺射线与杯口射线都必须完整可见且互不与其他杯/路径重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:39:#    - stray pixel 仍最多 1 个，且不能落入任何 cup bbox 或任一预留射线上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:44:#      * output 中两条不同方向的单色射线分别继承这两种颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/35/code.py:49:#    - 两条射线都在杯外直行，路径预留避免与其他对象缠绕。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/32/code.py:13:#      的杯会把弹射线留在画布上，后处理的杯若撞到已有非背景像素就停止。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/32/code.py:28:# - 原无条件写出弹射线默认路径静态为空。D8 让这个前提失效，所以发射时必须在动态 `out` 上遇到\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/32/code.py:37:# - 所有边框同色这一变化在输入里直接可见；同时样例中至少有一对同色杯输出不同长度的发射线，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:29:#    operation cannot do that: moving a lone protrusion across the axis preserves\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:35:#    Each sprite also receives at least one movable protrusion, so the flip\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:56:#    human can compare input/output and notice that protrusions jump across the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:61:#    the moved protrusions are easy to attribute to the correct object. No extra\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:68:#    Build a symmetric clean core first. Choose output-side protrusion cells that\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:71:#    input-side protrusions. Oracle check requires `main(input) == output`.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:76:#    - Every generated protrusion has an empty mirrored destination, so the flip\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:156:    Flip each sprite's unmatched protrusions across its own strongest mirror axis.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:161:    - A few same-color pixels lack mirror partners and act as one-sided protrusions attached near the symmetric core.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:223:# -- CFG: movable protrusions --\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:399:    \"\"\"Return output-side protrusion cells whose mirrored input-side cell is in-bounds and empty.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/3/code.py:432:    \"\"\"Add output-side protrusions to out and mirrored input-side protrusions to inp.\"\"\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:19:#         2. 右侧弹射线长度仍为 5，但颜色序列按切片顺序循环，得到 [2,8,2,8,2]。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:20:#     - 若 mouth 中有三种颜色且顺序为 [4,1,3]、总内容数为 7，则输出射线是\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:33:#     - 原代码 `out[rr,cc] = content_col` 假设射线单色；融合后改为“按 mouth 切片顺序\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:38:#     - 继续使用 output-first：先放杯框和预期射线，再回填输入内容，最后用\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:40:#     - 每个杯的 bbox 仍需与其他杯保持至少 1-cell gap；所有射线路径仍必须与其他杯\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:41:#       bbox 和其他射线路径完全分离。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:47:#       同时射线出现多色循环，明显不同于原题的单色直线和 D3 的分块直线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:51:#         3. 射线颜色循环顺序来自 mouth 中颜色区域的顺序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:54:#     - stray pixel 仍最多 1 个，且永不进入 cup bbox，也不占用任何射线路径。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3dc255db/38/code.py:55:#     - 不让 border 色参与周期射线，避免输出上 border 框与射线视觉粘连。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_co