me/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/8/code.py:51:      - 原 overlap 检查用颜色判断 `cur == ctrl or val == ctrl`。在双色情形下这太脆弱，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/8/code.py:67:      人类从样例里会先看到对接几何和原题一致，然后发现输出不是“保留双色”也不是“统一单色”：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/16/code.py:48:#    - A human can inspect an input/output pair and notice that some objects lose left/right protrusions while another\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/16/code.py:49:#      loses top-only or bottom-only protrusions. Because the critical sprite's noise spans both halves of the wrong\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/24/code.py:3:# Name: 双色翻转颜色交换\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c416de3/17/code.py:27:#      与原题不同，inner 不会在一开始就补全；与纯嵌套复制不同，补全后的图案还是双色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c416de3/17/code.py:30:#    - 若 inner 只做“同角位单步复制”，视觉上会太像 D7；若去掉双色 tail/head，顺序信息又会退化。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c416de3/17/code.py:31:#      因此这里强制两段都使用链式双色着色，使融合行为在输出里肉眼可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9bbf930d/34/code.py:3:# Name: 直线射线+粒子互相阻挡\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/25/code.py:37:# - 差异点有三层同时出现：同一条射线上有多次颜色切换；每次切换前不是纯色而是\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/25/code.py:61:# - 活跃线仍两两至少隔 1 行/列，因此不同射线不会重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/25/code.py:81:#   就是最后一个 companion 的颜色。颜色映射线索直接写在输入中。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/19/code.py:63:#    exactly the same placement but prunes asymmetric protrusions according to the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/26/code.py:33:# - 若活跃线碰到首尾行(列)，tight crop 在垂直于射线的方向上就不明显；本变体把活跃线放在\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/26/code.py:66:# - 假设 2：tight crop 之后仍能看出射线方向。generator 保证至少 4 条活跃线，并让它们共享同一\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/88e364bc/1/code.py:13:#     - D1/0: 方向不再来自双色质心，而是来自 5x5 图例里由墙色 C 画出的粗箭头轮廓。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:32:#    The crucial combo-specific difference is that relay activation no longer\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:38:#    - exactly one guaranteed relay chain of three rays,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:49:#      a ray and can still be the relay handoff.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:53:#    - \"Every non-empty line has a repeating color\" is invalid: relay-support rows\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:59:#    - The relay column/row is reserved from all unrelated dots, preventing\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:73:#      relay chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:79:#    output. The only shared cells are the relay handoffs themselves.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:83:#      current row/column; generator enforces that for the edge ray and every relay.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:85:#      generator builds all relay pairs with a consistent forward continuation.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:131:    Launch periodic rays from one edge, stop them on collision, and relay from hit nodes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:140:      those are dormant relay sources until a ray physically collides with them.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:152:    blockers now have two possible roles: passive walls or relay handoffs. The cascade\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:359:        relay_cols = [\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:366:        random.shuffle(relay_cols)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:367:        for c1 in relay_cols:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:412:    raise ValueError(\"Failed to build row-based relay chain\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:435:        relay_rows = [\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:442:        random.shuffle(relay_rows)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:443:        for r1 in relay_rows:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/8/code.py:488:    raise ValueError(\"Failed to build col-based relay chain\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/20/code.py:38:     * in this combo, if the base also has a non-connector protrusion at column 4 on some\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/20270e3b/20/code.py:39:       aligned row, the plug hits that protrusion first and stops with its nearest column at 3.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/36/code.py:25:#      只在剩余区域里从各自独占色锚点出发恢复整块双色对象，然后按共享轴删去任一颜色上的单边噪声。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/36/code.py:28:#      且轴属于整个双色精灵而不是单一颜色层”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/36/code.py:37:#    - 每个颜色自己找轴：原本默认轴只属于该颜色层。融合后轴属于整个双色精灵，必须在两色并集上找。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/36/code.py:52:#    - 双色对象采用“主色外层 + 辅色中轴附近少量成组区域”的稳定结构，能看出是一个对象而不是两个混杂块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/36/code.py:56:#    - 共享关系只有 1 组，且在每个样例里恰好重复两次，便于从少量样例归纳“共享色后处理、但仍按局部双色对象修复”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:41:#      (initial boundary source -> relay -> relay) so the multi-step behavior is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:51:#      dots are one cell off the boundary and relay sources are internal.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:53:#      relay sources use one visible source cell plus two same-color guide dots.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:62:#    - Simple initial lines are forbidden from placing dots on the relay column or\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:63:#      relay row, so accidental earlier companions cannot corrupt the cascade.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:71:#      again (or the transposed version). Other lines avoid the relay corridor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:80:#    - `relay_count`: number of activated non-boundary sources; every valid sample\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:87:#    - Relay sources are recognized only when the hit cell itself has the relay\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:91:#      valid companion. Generator placement reserves the relay corridor so nothing\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:172:def _relay_source_from_hit(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:203:                \"kind\": \"relay\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:285:    relay_count = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:299:        if str(info[\"kind\"]) == \"relay\":\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:300:            relay_count += 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:313:        relay = _relay_source_from_hit(g, bg, next_orientation, next_line, next_source_pos, paint)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:314:        if relay is not None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:315:            queue.append(relay)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:322:        \"relay_count\": relay_count,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:335:    Fill locally directed periodic rays, then relay them through struck companions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:344:    - Some on-beat companions also encode relay sources: the struck cell itself\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:358:      the hit cell plus two same-color guide dots form a legal relay source there,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:419:def _place_relay_guides(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:460:        raise ValueError(\"No legal step that avoids the relay corridor\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:512:        raise ValueError(\"Need a free row for the final relay\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:569:        _place_relay_guides(inp, \"col\", c1, r1, side2, color_b, step2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:571:        _place_relay_guides(inp, \"row\", r2, c1, side3, color_c, step3)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:585:        raise ValueError(\"Need a free col for the final relay\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:642:        _place_relay_guides(inp, \"row\", r1, c1, side2, color_b, step2)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:644:        _place_relay_guides(inp, \"col\", c2, r1, side3, color_c, step3)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:674:            relay_col, _ = _build_row_chain(inp, active_rows, palette)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:693:                    {relay_col},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:711:            relay_row, _ = _build_col_chain(inp, active_cols, palette)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:730:                    {relay_row},\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/24/code.py:742:    if int(meta[\"relay_count\"]) < 2:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/13/code.py:17:#    - 现在每个对象是一个 4 连通的双色精灵，而不是“一个颜色层 = 一个对象”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/13/code.py:22:#      融合版先把整个双色连通精灵当作一个对象，再搜索共享的横纵轴对，并要求四重轨道里的所有位置都存在且同色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8e5c0c38/13/code.py:51:#      这样保留下来的输入必须同时依赖“双色共享对象”与“四重对称”两个维度。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/1/code.py:19:#    - 原题每条活跃射线只有 2 个同色 marker，因此步长就是那两个点的差；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/1/code.py:53:#      会有射线之间的像素重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/49/code.py:3:# Name: 射线重着色框架+反射弹跳\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/20/code.py:25:#   shooting edge 上；另一个 marker 恰好沿射线方向前进 1 个 step。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/20/code.py:49:# - 生成器因此必须保证 companion 真的是“沿射线方向、位于 inner marker 之后”的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/20/code.py:58:# - 活跃行/列索引保持至少 1 个空隔，因此不同射线在视觉上分开。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/20/code.py:74:# - 颜色变化完全由结构触发：谁在同一 beat 上、并且更靠射线前方，谁就接管后续颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:10:#       - 框边上的背景缺口仍是射线起点；角缺口发对角线，边缺口发水平/垂直线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:14:#       - D7/1 规定其他框的绿色边框也属于“非背景障碍物”；同一个框既能发射，也能挡住别人的射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:18:#       - 原题：这类输入会被 generator 回避，否则 solver 会把撞框视作非法，或若改造成射线相撞则继续转向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:19:#       - D6 单变体：左射线会在右框实墙前停止，但若样例里没有“撞框”布局，这个变化不显眼。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:20:#       - 本融合版：左射线稳定表现为“缺口 + 若干背景格”后在右框绿墙前戛然而止；右框同时还会发出自己的一条射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:21:#       - 差异核心不是颜色映射，而是观察到绿色框既是发射器，又是其它射线的终点屏障。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:23:#     - 若继续沿用原题 generator 的“所有射线都只穿背景到边界”约束，这个融合会退化成普通 D6 直线版，D7 完全不可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:24:#     - 因此 generator 强制至少制造 1 组“框挡射线”事件，并把每个框限制为恰好 1 个缺口，避免多束同色射线造成视觉歧义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:29:#     - 原 generator 默认框绝不能落在射线路径上；融合后恰恰要故意安排一条路径撞上别框的实墙，但仍需避免撞上别框的缺口。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:30:#     - 新 solver 还隐含一个同步假设：若多条射线同一步争抢同一空白格，则都停且不落格。generator 通过路径互斥避免样例依赖这一细枝末节。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:34:#     - 目标框自己的缺口禁止开在被撞的墙格上；其余框额外随机放置，但只选边界向外的单缺口并要求所有射线路径互不相交。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:36:#     - 每个样例至少有 1 条射线在边界之前被另一个绿色框截断，这是融合规则最重要的肉眼证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:37:#     - 同时保留若干直达边界的射线，让解题者能对比“为什么有的线变短，有的线很长”，从而归纳出障碍物作用。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/9/code.py:47:#     - solver 允许射线因边界、框墙、色块或已画射线而停止；generator 额外保证训练样例几乎总是“边界或框墙”两类终止，提升可推断性。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/9/code.py:32:#     - generator 只取 left/right 射线，并把 step 收紧到 3-4；这是因为原始高度上限 12 会把 top/bottom 样例压回\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/45/code.py:3:# Name: 方向正交映射+正交射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/10/code.py:37:#    - 每个框只开一个 gap, 减少多射线互相干扰, 保证 solver 中的新分支只在目标场景被触发.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/19/code.py:3:# Name: 正交射线+颜色交换+周期涂色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/27/code.py:3:# Name: 裁剪到射线区域+框架消失\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e4f6532/16/code.py:59:#   patches have enough room for marker protrusions and body growth.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/24/code.py:3:# Name: 射线重着色框架+多色框架\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:14:#    - 保留原题的对象字典: 每个对象仍是 4x4 边框包住 2x2 纯色块, 缺口向外发射直线射线.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:16:#      射线始终沿初始方向直走到边界或非背景输入像素, 只在碰撞局部改颜色.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:18:#      1) 混色层: 碰撞附近的相邻射线格改成第三种块色, 用来表达是哪两种颜色相撞.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:26:#    - 若碰撞太少, D9 的特殊标记和 D2 的混色都可能被误读为偶然噪声; 因此生成器强制 3 条射线两两碰撞.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:32:#      1) 先独立追踪每条直线射线, 不让碰撞反过来影响几何路径.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:37:#      生成器用固定三射线模板保证这两点.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:41:#    - 三条射线都只穿过背景, 不撞到别的框, 且碰撞局部不会互相重叠, 所以 `main()` 的局部覆写始终合法.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/5/code.py:47:#    - 交点中心只占 1 格, 混色只覆盖该中心周围紧邻的射线格, 不会把整条线都染乱.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/13/code.py:23:#    左射线 beat 为 0,2,4,6,8,10,12,14；在 4 处碰撞后由 A 改成 C。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/13/code.py:24:#    右射线 beat 为 15,12,9,6,3,0；在 9 处碰撞后由 B 改成 D。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/33/code.py:3:# Name: 边缘像素源+正交射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/1/code.py:3:# Name: 正交射线+碰撞即停\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/25/code.py:36:    - 为避免规则退化成“只是固定灰色模板”，生成器仍保留 7-15 个矩形、重复尺寸组、双色纹理和若干 1x1 小块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/6/code.py:21:#   1) 射线仍从唯一射击边出发，marker 的两个点定义 beat。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:9:# - Fuse the two changes by turning the layout into a visible relay chain. There is exactly one 1-gap source frame, then\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:10:#   three 2-gap relay frames. The source ray reaches frame B, which triggers B; B reaches C, which triggers C; C reaches D.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:11:# - The last relay then emits one more ray that collides with an already-drawn earlier segment. That collision does two\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:26:# - The chain length is fixed at 4 frames. This is the smallest size that cleanly shows source, relays, and a remote\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:37:# - The fused solver assumes: one source frame, three 2-gap relays, every relay hit is unique, and the only collision is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:45:#   relay target lies on the correct ray and no unintended frame or connector is crossed.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:62:# - Colors are never ordered by numeric id. Geometry determines source, relay order, and the collision pair; color only\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:246:        assert 1 <= len(gaps) <= 2, \"expected one source gap or two relay gaps\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:307:                assert next_frame not in activated, \"chain must move to a fresh relay\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:315:                raise AssertionError(\"relay connectors must pass only through background\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/36/code.py:348:    assert len(activated) == len(frames), \"every frame should participate in the relay chain\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/14/code.py:19:#   射击边上，射线从该边朝网格内部按 beat 前进。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/14/code.py:30:#   也就是 companion 位置本身完成颜色互换，射线从下一个 beat 开始改用 companion 色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/16de56c4/14/code.py:62:#   2-3 个样例里直接看出“撞上去发生互换但射线没停”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/50/code.py:17:#   - 原题：一条向右的射线和一条右下对角射线在同一格相遇，会并成 zigzag，交点不空。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/50/code.py:18:#   - 现在：同样两束光仍统一改向到右下，但不会画 zigzag；它们会在碰撞后各自的出射道上先跳过 2 格空白，再继续画细单像素射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/50/code.py:40:# - 每个区只放两条会相遇的射线，所有框架都保持至少原题要求的 2-cell bbox clearance。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/50/code.py:41:# - 每条射线都先有足够长的无碰撞跑道，碰撞后的统一出射方向也预留了额外空间，避免 gap 段越界或撞到别的框。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/50/code.py:45:# - 由于所有射线都保持 1 像素宽，视觉上最显眼的变化就是空隙长度 1/2/3；解题者在 2-4 个样例里能直接比对出来。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/35ab12c3/7/code.py:3:# Name: 边缘像素源+射线延伸到网格边缘\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/13/code.py:3:# Name: 仅输出射线+发射后框架消失\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/3/code.py:28:#    - 小例子：某个输出洞里是一个 2x4 的双色 L 形 patch，但不同 piece 的内部朝向本身也会变化。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/3/code.py:35:#    - 所有 core 都用同一种非旋转对称的双色 L 形母板，但输出中的朝向会混合出现；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/3/code.py:56:#      core 的双色只负责让朝向可见，但不会单独决定一个全局“标准朝向”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/42/code.py:29:#      straight through the marker while the relay happens in the hidden beam identity. The marker is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/42/code.py:64:#      its own 2x2 block, and the only new visible color is the fixed collision marker. The relay of\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/42/code.py:456:    Emit diagonal beams from framed 2x2 blocks; collisions become marked relay nodes instead of the original turns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/20/code.py:3:# Name: 双色字形的颜色编码\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/20/code.py:24:#     [左上角=红(2), 其余=橙(7)] 的双色 cross，则 area 6 只给出长度 4，红色标记给出\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/20/code.py:34:#   - 原 solver 用 `monochromatic=True` 找单色组件，这在双色字形下失效；现在必须用\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/20/code.py:35:#     `monochromatic=False` 把整个双色 glyph 当作一个 8 连通前景组件处理。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/6e4f6532/14/code.py:50:#    4-neighbor protrusion from the 8-body, never overlaps couplers or stripes, and is rejected\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:14:#    - 保留原题的对象骨架: 4x4 框包住 2x2 单色块, 缺口发射射线.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:16:#      本融合版彻底取消碰撞后的轨迹变化: 每条射线始终按初始方向直走到边界.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:17:#    - 真正的变化只发生在碰撞位点: 若两条射线来自同一色系, 交点改涂 `SAME_FAMILY_MIX`;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:24:#    - 每张图都强制出现 4 条射线的全部 6 组两两碰撞: 其中 2 组是同系, 4 组是异系.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:31:#      这样碰撞标记不会反过来影响别的射线继续前进.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:34:#    - 该模板保证 6 个碰撞位点彼此分离, 且任意射线都不会撞到别的框.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/32/code.py:41:#    - 每块只有 1 条射线, 没有原题那种碰撞后再次分叉造成的复杂纹理.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/7/code.py:33:#    - 逐色追踪连续段默认每条输入线是单色: 仍成立，生成器保证输入不含双色线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e376de54/7/code.py:51:#    每条线最多只有两种颜色，而且双色只出现在同一直线的连续两段中；不存在\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:10:#       - 缺口本身仍是背景色，输出中会先被对应块颜色填上，然后沿缺口朝外发射一条直线射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:14:#       - 原题：这种输入不合法，因为额外前景不存在，而且射线若遇其他射线会继续发生 45/90 度碰撞转向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:15:#       - 仅 D15/0 的参考实现：灰点会把射线顺时针折走。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:16:#       - 本融合版：灰点不提供特殊转向，射线会在灰点前一格停止；若路径上先遇到别的框、内块或已画射线，也同样停止。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:19:#     - 若 generator 沿用原题“射线只穿背景直到边界”的约束，那么 D15 的新增障碍物完全不可见，任务会退化成普通 D6。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:20:#     - 为了稳定显出融合效应，生成器强制至少一条射线被孤立障碍物截断，并额外保留一条被框体截断的射线，让解题者看出“障碍物和原有前景同样会挡住射线”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:21:#     - 为减少无关复杂度，每个框固定只放 1 个缺口。这样每个 2x2 颜色只对应 1 条射线，观察者不必处理同色多束线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:27:#     - 同步更新里，两个射线若同一步争抢同一背景格，输入里那一格事先不是前景。这里采用 D6 单变体的自然同步扩展：双方都停下且该格不着色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:30:#     - 生成器先构造一对强制对齐的框，使第一条射线在至少 2 格背景后撞到另一个框，从而保留“框也是墙”的例子。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:34:#     - 每个样例至少出现一次“射线在孤立前景点前停下”的现象，这是 D15/0 在本融合规则里的核心证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:35:#     - 同时至少保留一次“射线在别的框前停下”的现象，帮助人把规则归纳成“所有前景都挡路”，而不是“只有灰点挡路”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:41:#     - 不做颜色映射：射线颜色仍等于其 2x2 内块颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/14/code.py:45:#     - solver 支持射线同一步争抢同一空格时的“全停”分支；generator 继续尽量避免这种次要情况，让样例主要展示静态前景阻挡。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/12/code.py:18:#      visible relay chain whose activation order is determined by center distance, not by colors or ids.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/12/code.py:27:#      The observable difference is that the entry gap of each relay is painted by the predecessor color, and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/12/code.py:43:#      uses one active relay step at a time, so older trails are fixed history rather than simultaneous peers.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/12/code.py:330:        assert mid in incoming and mid in outgoing, \"middle relay must have both entry and exit\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/12/code.py:334:    assert last in incoming, \"last relay must have an incoming gap\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/40/code.py:3:# Name: 正交射线+碰撞转90度+始终单像素\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/dd6b8c4b_parent_review.json:9:      \"variant_name\": \"直线射线可达性\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/dd6b8c4b_parent_review.json:10:      \"prompt_variant_name\": \"直线射线可达性\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/dim_analysis_prompt_builder.py:267:    - ray → 射线（发射的线段）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/dim_analysis_prompt_builder.py:268:    - port → 端口（射线发射点）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/332f06d7_parent_review.json:87:      \"variant_name\": \"直线射线导航\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/332f06d7_parent_review.json:88:      \"prompt_variant_name\": \"直线射线导航\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/332f06d7_parent_review.md:9:| 332f06d7 | D1 | 1 | 直线射线导航 | 12/12 | ✓ |\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/332f06d7_parent_review.md:58:## D1/1 直线射线导航\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e12f9a14/2/code.py:3:# Name: 正交射线+周期涂色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/8/code.py:46:    - chain length 3 is the smallest size that visibly exhibits a middle relay sprite without overcrowding 10x10\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/dd6b8c4b_parent_review.md:8:| dd6b8c4b | D1 | 0 | 直线射线可达性 | 12/12 | ✓ |\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/review/dd6b8c4b_parent_review.md:23:## D1/0 直线射线可达性\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/30/code.py:3:# Name: 双色编码与长度着色系统\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/30/code.py:29:#    - 为落实 D3 的“双色字形”，每个 3x3 模板都改成双色：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/30/code.py:47:#      否则解题者可能把规则误读成“某个双色模板直接对应一条固定指令”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/136b0064/30/code.py:57:#    - 仍采用 path-first：先采样合法指令序列，再编码回双色字形。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/29/code.py:20:- 原题的源对象是 3 像素 L，输出规则是从直角顶点沿缺角反方向发出对角射线，遇墙反射，直到出界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/29/code.py:37:    之后射线仍按原题方式逐步对角前进、侧碰墙翻单轴、正撞墙翻双轴并继承墙颜色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/29/code.py:64:- 箭头、墙、射线轨迹彼此不重叠；所有坐标都做 in-bounds 检查。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/5dbc8537/22/code.py:3:# Name: 全双色精灵颜色互换填入\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/18/code.py:24:       3 像素轴对齐直线墙 = pass，只改射线颜色，不改方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/18/code.py:25:   - 具体小例子：方向 (1,1) 的射线走到 (r,c)。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/18/code.py:50:   - pass 墙允许被射线在后续一步踏入 1 个像素，这是变体语义的一部分；solver 显式支持。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/18/code.py:61:   - 墙只放在射线路径相邻 1 格处，仍保留原题家族的稀疏观感。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/1/code.py:72:#    - solver 假设目标精灵在输入中仍是合法的双色 bordered sprite；generator 只改颜色不改几何。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:11:#      入射角=反射角规则，这个融合版把射线段具体化为正交的水平/垂直折线；L 形缺角仍然决定四个发射态，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:20:#      其中中心像素正好放在射线正前方一格，所以“撞墙”发生在墙前一格；该格被改涂成墙色，之后射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:23:#         当前射线在 (5,5)，方向向右，前方中心镜面在 (5,6)。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:41:#    - 原 `nr = cur + (dr,dc)` 假设一条射线永远按对角线前进。融合后不成立，必须改成四个正交方向之一。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/25/code.py:342:    Trace orthogonal rays from L-shaped arrows and reflect them on diagonal mirrors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/28a6681f/37/code.py:77:# - 图面分成上下两层：上半是整齐的贴边双色水库，下半是 3 行厚的盆地/台阶。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:7:#    - 保留原题对象：3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙、对角线射线、撞墙换色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/27/code.py:16:#      即每条射线最多 3 段。solver 仍对更长段序列稳健处理：第 4 段及以后按 1 格前缀显示。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/eee78d87/3/code.py:3:# Name: 双色字形+保留原色印章\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/24/code.py:3:# Name: 直线射线+正面阻挡墙壁\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:3:# Name: 直线射线+颜色编码转向\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:8:#    - 保留原题的对象家族：背景 0；单色 3 像素 L 形箭头；单像素或 3 像素直线墙。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:9:#    - 原题里箭头从 L 形缺角信息解码出对角方向 `(dr, dc)`，射线每步都沿 45 度移动。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:10:#      碰到墙后，反射方向由“墙在射线哪一侧”决定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:12:#      1. 射线不再走对角线，而是一次只走一个正交方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:47:#    - 箭头、墙、规划出的射线路径三者都不共享格子。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:49:#      这样既像“挡板”，又不会覆盖射线终点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:60:#    - 每条射线至少有若干长度为 2+ 的直段，墙只出现在拐点正前方，整体像少量清晰的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:64:#    - 颜色变化只有一层语义：墙色 == 转向方向，同时反射后射线继承墙色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/1/code.py:271:    Trace orthogonal rays from L-shaped arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:15:#   - 保留原题对象词汇：3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙像素、对角线射线、侧碰/正撞反射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:16:#   - 融合后的关键区别不是“射线轨迹互相变成墙”，而是“箭头按距离顺序发射，并共享一套会被擦除的活墙集合”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:17:#   - 每次命中墙时：几何反射规则不变；射线继承墙色；被真正触碰的墙像素变成背景色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:33:#   - 原 “反射时把当前 ray cell 重涂成墙色” 的假设失效；现在 bounce cell 保持到达时的射线颜色，只有后续段继承墙色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:38:#   - 箭头、墙、两条射线的计划轨迹在输入中不重叠；输出中两条射线也不相交，避免颜色覆盖歧义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/7/code.py:44:#   - 每个样例只有 1 个关键墙和 2 条不相交射线，局部因果关系集中，输出不会变成杂乱的多层折线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/d35bdbdc/2/code.py:51:# - 交换后的 source 仍是清晰的双色 box/plus，不会像“变纯色”那样过于接近背景逻辑，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:16:#   - 原题的 3 像素 L 形箭头改成“边框单像素控制点”。控制点本身就是射线源，方向由其所在边和半边位置编码。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:17:#   - 每条射线都有一个内部单像素目标。射线进入目标格时立刻停止，目标色在输出里保持不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:24:#   - 若射线沿 (1,1) 前进，在 (4,6) 处侧碰到位于 (5,6) 的水平墙，则当前格 (4,6) 继承墙色，dr 翻转成 -1，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:25:#     射线后续沿 (-1,1) 继续。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:26:#   - 若再走到下一段末尾的目标 (2,8)，则射线进入该目标并停止；不会再像原题那样继续飞到出界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:30:#   - 保留对角线射线与原反射物理；不引入水平/垂直射线，否则会把题目从“读边框位置编码”扩成另一套动力学。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:35:#   - 原 `is_arrow_pts` / `arrow_dir_and_start` 的 L 形箭头假设全部失效，改成 `_control_dir`。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/20/code.py:53:#   - `main()` 中每个循环都假设单条射线不会与别的射线共享绘制格；生成器用 output-first 规划并拒绝交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:13:#    - 同时引入 D4/0 的“颜色混合”：射线颜色不再继承墙色，而是在一个小循环色集\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:18:#      因此“新颜色”同时依赖当前射线颜色和墙色，而不是只看墙色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:23:#      但颜色结果又保留了当前射线颜色的记忆。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:37:#    - 原颜色更新 `cur_col = wall_color` 失效；现在必须先读取当前射线颜色，再做混色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:43:#    - 继续用 output-first：先规划每条射线的颜色序列与折线路径，再反推出输入中的箭头和墙。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:44:#    - 墙、箭头、射线轨迹都不能重叠；同色墙还不能 4 邻接，避免同色墙拼成 3 像素 L 形连通块，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/2/code.py:154:    Trace diagonal rays from L-shaped arrows.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:23:      - 原题的几何对象不变：单色 3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙、45 度对角线射线、侧碰反射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:27:      - 射线颜色不再继承墙色；每次反射后改用提示条中的下一个颜色，超出后循环。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/9/code.py:70:      - 每个非最终段都预留至少 1 格边界余量，以确保反射墙可以合法放在射线侧边。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/9/code.py:23:      - 顶部双色精灵按外层颜色匹配到底部某条横条。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/9/code.py:55:    - 原代码按颜色逐个连通域抽 bbox，因此双色精灵会额外生成一个“内层单色子组件”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7c66cb00/9/code.py:63:      包括双色精灵额外诱发的内层单色子组件。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:22:#   - 保留原题对象词汇：3 像素 L 形箭头、单色墙像素/短线段、沿对角线行进且会继承墙色的射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:47:#   - 箭头、射线路径、墙像素三者必须严格不重叠，且全部在边界内。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:49:#   - 生成器在构造后再次跑箭头检测，确保没有墙组件伪装成第二个 L 形箭头。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:51:#   - 输入里只有一个显眼的 L 形箭头和许多分散墙标记；输出里是一条长锯齿彩色路径，视觉上和原题的多短线明显不同。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/10/code.py:232:    Trace diagonal rays from L-shaped arrows, reflecting off wall pixels and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/21/code.py:3:# Name: 单像素射线源+目标像素终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/21/code.py:16:#   - 原题源对象是 3 像素 L 形箭头；这里改成“边框上的单像素控制点”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/21/code.py:19:#   - 终止条件沿用 D6/0：网格内部放置单像素目标点，射线若下一步正好走进目标点，就立刻停下，不再继续\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/21/code.py:29:#   - 为避免样例退化成只看角落，生成器偏向非角落控制点；为避免目标规则太隐蔽，样例通常含 2-6 条射线、\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/21/code.py:44:#   - 墙只能是 3 像素水平/竖直线段，且全部在内部，不能与已有源、目标、射线路径重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/21/code.py:57:#   - 颜色继承规则不变：射线起始色来自 source，撞墙后继承墙色；目标色则保持为专用标记色，不参与映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/4/code.py:16:#    - 原题源对象是 3 像素 L 形，缺角编码对角方向，射线从直角像素出发。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/4/code.py:34:#    - 正交源只出现在边中点 1-2 个格子上，类别少、可学，但不会淹没原题的射线反射风格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/142ca369/4/code.py:42:# 