int(color_b)), rng)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:32:#       然后提取“非 body 区域”作为 3 格双色连接器，并记录它的彩色归一化形状。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:33:#       destination 中每个提示也按 4 连通组件读取为一个 3 格双色连接器，再做模板匹配。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:62:#       1) source/output 精灵是三色而不是双色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:63:#       2) destination 不是单点标记，而是 3 格双色连接器。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a251c730/7/code.py:78:#     - destination 每个组件都恰为一个 3 格双色连接器，其彩色归一化形状在 source 中唯一匹配。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/23/code.py:12:#    next cleanup it is shaved into small black gaps/protrusions, and those new black cells can\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/23/code.py:303:    - Work in rounds. In each round, first clean the current foreground arrangement until local one-cell noise/protrusions are stable.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/5/code.py:3:# Name: 射线到碰撞/边界+静态墙壁\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/22/code.py:113:    Remove one-cell specks/protrusions before detecting black dents.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/41/code.py:110:    Remove one-cell specks/protrusions before detecting black dents.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/41/code.py:226:      or short protrusions near the boundary between the two regions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/409aa875/23/code.py:3:# Name: 射线到碰撞+传送门\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/6/code.py:90:    Remove one-cell specks/protrusions before detecting black dents.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/14/code.py:204:    - The corruptions come in two kinds: cross-color boundary protrusions between the main regions, and isolated\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/14/code.py:209:      regions: boundary protrusions are recolored into the locally dominant region, while isolated background specks\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:18:#         protrusions back into the surrounding host region;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:25:#      3) each one-cell region-region protrusion is no longer erased semantically:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:34:#      old protrusion:   [a a a]      old cleanup/output center -> a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:37:#      combo protrusion: cleanup still says host is `a`, but the final output center\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:38:#      is teal at that same location, so protrusions remain visible instead of vanishing.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:41:#    - The combo would collapse visually if samples had only dents or only protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:42:#      The generator therefore enforces both: many dents and 3-6 protrusions per sample.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:51:#    - The original `_clean_foreground` treated protrusions as disposable corruption.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:53:#      baseline reconstruction step before we re-mark protrusion cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:55:#      both combo signals: dent centers would not be forced back to black, and protrusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:58:#      because protrusions are handled by a separate detector on foreground cells whose\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:62:#    - Dents and protrusions use global Chebyshev separation >= 3, except for optional\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:64:#      and prevents protrusion markers from landing inside a dent patch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:68:#      removable noise rather than creating accidental new protrusions or dents.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:79:#      protrusion markers. That is still a compact palette.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:80:#    - Because protrusions are not expanded into patches in this combo, teal remains a\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:90:#      non-black one-cell protrusion -> teal point.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:91:#    - Repeated examples support the inference that teal means \"protrusion\" while black\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:95:#    - Every protrusion marker in the output must correspond to an input foreground cell\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:100:#    - No protrusion center may fall inside any dent patch, or the teal marker would\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:117:# --- CFG: protrusions ---\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:161:    protrusions collapse back into the local host region. The combo then reuses this\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:163:    were protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:215:def _protrusion_centers(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:247:    Turn black dents into hollow opposite-color patches and keep protrusions as teal markers.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:252:      and a few one-cell protrusions where one foreground color pokes into the other.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:256:      specks and collapsing one-cell protrusions back into the surrounding host region.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:260:    - Every original one-cell protrusion that cleanup rewrites into the other foreground\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:267:      that cleanup erases as protrusions are reintroduced as teal markers. Teal therefore\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:268:      marks protrusions only, and black can mean either true background or a dent center.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:277:    protrusions = _protrusion_centers(g, clean, colors)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:287:    for r, c in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:424:def _neighbor_protrusion_safe(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:455:def _safe_protrusion_candidate(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:489:    if not _neighbor_protrusion_safe(clean, r, c, source, host, bg):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:494:def _find_protrusion_candidates(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:505:            if host == color_a and _safe_protrusion_candidate(clean, r, c, color_b, color_a, bg):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:507:            elif host == color_b and _safe_protrusion_candidate(clean, r, c, color_a, color_b, bg):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:516:    protrusions: list[tuple[int, int, int]],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:531:    for r, c, _source in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:608:    protrusion_candidates = _find_protrusion_candidates(clean, colors, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:609:    desired_hi = min(PROTRUSION_COUNT_MAX, len(protrusion_candidates))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:613:    protrusion_positions = None\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:615:        protrusion_positions = _pick_separated_centers(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:616:            [(r, c) for r, c, _source in protrusion_candidates],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:621:        if protrusion_positions is not None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:623:    if protrusion_positions is None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:626:    chosen_pos = set(protrusion_positions)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:627:    protrusions = [(r, c, source) for r, c, source in protrusion_candidates if (r, c) in chosen_pos]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:628:    if len(protrusions) != len(chosen_pos):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:631:    output = _build_output(clean, groups_a, groups_b, protrusions, color_a, color_b, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/de809cff/12/code.py:637:    for r, c, source in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D11/1/code.py:26:  变体 tile0 是 `A B A B A` 一条双色交替墙 + 1 个颜色 I 的指示点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D11/1/code.py:33:- 这个变化肉眼可见：tile0 会稳定出现“双色条纹墙 + 第三色指示点”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7491f3cf/D11/1/code.py:51:- 不增加额外标记，不改变面板排布，只把旧墙重涂成双色条纹，因此整体仍然干净。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D2/3/code.py:17:#         the same two red pixels plus a 2-cell protrusion on the outside of the connector\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D2/3/code.py:137:    - The finished assembly is valid only if every red connector is paired and every internal cavity from the input pieces is filled by another piece's colored protrusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f3a5a89/5/code.py:3:# Name: 射线扫描+目标像素碰撞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:27:#      columns in the frame, and a direct \"align four protrusions to four columns\" move.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:29:#      there are now two candidate bars, each bar has 5 or 6 colored protrusions, and the frame still\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:31:#    - The intended bar contains exactly one consecutive 4-protrusion color window whose left->right\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:32:#      colors equal the frame's 4 slot-column colors. Any remaining protrusions are edge extras with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:33:#      non-frame colors. The other bar is a distractor with 5 or 6 protrusions too, but its best\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:34:#      4-protrusion window only matches 2-3 frame colors in the correct positions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:36:#        old task: choose the only bar -> align all protrusions by absolute columns -> stack colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:39:#                    the frame -> stack the frame colors above those 4 matched protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:45:#    - The bar side adds only two bounded freedoms: 5 vs 6 protrusions, and the active 4-window can\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:53:#      are no longer grey-only because their protrusions are colored. The solver must inspect\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:55:#    - \"All protrusions are used\" breaks because each chosen bar has 5 or 6 protrusions but only 4\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:56:#      can map to the frame. The solver must crop to the matched 4-protrusion core.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:58:#      extra protrusions create multiple geometric windows. The decisive cue is the color sequence.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:59:#    - New fused assumption: the useful 4 protrusions form one consecutive block. The generator keeps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:67:#    - All protrusion heights are sampled in [2,4], ensuring each protrusion has at least one visible\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:71:#    - A human sees one frame with 4 distinct slot colors and two separate bars whose protrusions are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:75:#      identify which protrusions matter, not just count protrusions or always drop the right edge.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:78:#    - Extra protrusions are confined to bar edges, so the input stays readable and the output remains\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:85:#      colors in order, while its extra protrusions use colors outside that 4-color set.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:91:#    - Exactly one candidate bar has a consecutive 4-protrusion window with perfect ordered color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:94:#    - The chosen bar has 5 or 6 protrusions, and the winning window start varies across samples.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:101:#    - Bar scoring assumes protrusions are evenly spaced enough for a constant-dx 4-window test; both\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:190:    Pick the better-matching colored bar, keep only its useful 4-protrusion core, and insert it into the frame.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:194:    - The frame contains exactly four colored slot columns, while each bar has a grey base and five or six upward colored protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:197:    - Read the four frame-column colors from left to right, then score each bar by the best consecutive four-protrusion window whose columns can translate onto the frame columns.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:198:    - Choose the bar with the higher ordered color-match score, keep only that winning four-protrusion window, and move the cropped 7-cell core upward into the frame so its base sits one cell above the interior floor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:199:    - Preserve the frame, erase both input bars, and restack each frame column's colored cells immediately above the aligned protrusion in the inserted core.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/29/code.py:202:    - Geometry alone is no longer enough: both candidate bars have extra protrusions, so the solver must use ordered color agreement to choose the correct bar and then crop away the unmatched edge protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/8f3a5a89/13/code.py:3:# Name: 二值化输出+双色背景\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:9:      - The original task had three fixed crutches: exactly four protrusions, fixed slot-column lengths\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:11:      - This combo removes all three supports at once: the bar now has 2-5 protrusions, each frame column\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:13:      - The intended solver must therefore detect the two structural objects by shape, count the protrusions,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:18:      - Example parameters: 3 protrusions, slot lengths [6,2,5], colored counts [4,1,3], protrusion heights\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:31:      - Keeping one active column per protrusion preserves a clean one-to-one mapping, so the task is still\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:45:      - \"Largest grey component = frame, second-largest = bar\" is unsafe here because with only 2 protrusions the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:48:        once protrusion count and positions are randomized.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:66:      - For `n` protrusions, frame width is `2*n+3`, bar width is `2*n-1`, active frame columns are\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:83:      - After implementation, measure the tuple `(protrusion_count, slot_lengths, frame_origin, bar_origin)` on\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:87:      - Generator calls intentionally rotate through protrusion counts and the four relative-layout modes before\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:306:def _frame_patch(protrusion_count: int) -> np.ndarray:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:307:    width = 2 * protrusion_count + 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:330:def _slot_cols(frame_c0: int, protrusion_count: int) -> list[int]:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:331:    return [frame_c0 + 2 + 2 * i for i in range(protrusion_count)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:420:    protrusion_count: int | None = None,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:423:    if protrusion_count is None:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:424:        protrusion_count = int(rng.integers(PROTRUSION_RANGE[0], PROTRUSION_RANGE[1] + 1))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:425:    heights = [int(rng.integers(HEIGHT_RANGE[0], HEIGHT_RANGE[1] + 1)) for _ in range(protrusion_count)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:426:    lengths = [int(rng.integers(LENGTH_RANGE[0], LENGTH_RANGE[1] + 1)) for _ in range(protrusion_count)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:428:    colors = [int(v) for v in rng.choice(PALETTE, size=protrusion_count, replace=False)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:429:    frame_w = 2 * protrusion_count + 3\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:430:    bar_w = 2 * protrusion_count - 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:435:    return protrusion_count, heights, lengths, counts, colors, frame_r0, frame_c0, bar_r0, bar_c0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:439:    protrusion_count: int,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:452:    frame_patch = _frame_patch(protrusion_count)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:464:        zip(_slot_cols(frame_c0, protrusion_count), lengths, counts, colors, heights)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:476:    protrusion_count: int | None = None,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:479:    params = _sample_params(rng, protrusion_count=protrusion_count, layout_mode=layout_mode)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:483:        protrusion_count,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:495:        protrusion_count,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:507:        protrusion_count,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:531:    protrusion_values = list(range(PROTRUSION_RANGE[0], PROTRUSION_RANGE[1] + 1))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:534:    target_n = protrusion_values[base_idx % len(protrusion_values)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:535:    target_mode = LAYOUT_MODES[(base_idx // len(protrusion_values)) % len(LAYOUT_MODES)]\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:538:            grid = _gen_attempt(rng, protrusion_count=target_n, layout_mode=target_mode)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/18/code.py:541:        target_n = int(rng.choice(protrusion_values))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D8/1/code.py:243:    - Color no longer identifies connectors. The signal is geometric: connectors are the short exposed edge tabs, so the puzzle is solved by pairing compatible boundary protrusions rather than by chasing red pixels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/29/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头直线贯穿射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/195c6913/13/code.py:16:#      1. 运动控制从“射线 + 碰撞时交替转向”变成“由螺旋几何直接决定的连续转弯”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b10624e5/14/code.py:25:# - 若源图案本身水平/垂直完全对称，反射线索会变弱。生成器显式拒绝这类弱样本。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/8/code.py:11:    - 输出仍然裁剪为框内区域，并在填充底色上画单色路径、双色交替 L 路径，或整列/整行条纹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/8/code.py:29:  - 最多只允许 1 个双色 L 组件，避免少量样例下出现多个 singleton 颜色导致配对歧义。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/8/code.py:37:  - 双色相位仍依赖端点颜色，但 generator 必须保证双色 L 的路径长度为偶数，这样两端颜色才不同且可由两个 singleton 控制像素锚定。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/8/code.py:48:  - 不使用颜色编号排序、黑色特殊义等不可视规则；颜色只承担组件身份与双色交替相位提示。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D19/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D19 — 射线碰撞后的转向方向 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D19/2/code.py:3:# Change: 碰撞后两条射线各转45度——具体转向方向由碰撞的几何关系决定... → 碰撞后沿墙壁方向转弯\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/0/code.py:3:# Change: collision_detection——90度交角碰撞时两条射线各转45度并在交叉点留1像素间隙、以单像素绘制；45度... → 碰撞即停止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/13e47133/8/code.py:19:#    - 生成器强制每个样本同时出现至少一个 marker 断点和至少一处墙带双色分裂，避免退化成任一单变体或原题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/11/code.py:3:# Name: 直线贯穿射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7491f3cf/17/code.py:3:# Name: 颜色匹配对应+双色编码\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:3:# Change: collision_detection——90度交角碰撞时两条射线各转45度并在交叉点留1像素间隙、以单像素绘制；45度... → 碰撞时颜色混合\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:14:#    - 这个变体仍然保留原题的对象形态: 4x4 框, 中间 2x2 纯色块, 边框缺口发射射线.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:17:#      现在射线始终沿原方向直走到边界, 碰撞位置只留下“第三种颜色”的标记.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:19:#      若两条不同颜色的射线相撞, 混色结果定义为“这一题 3 个块色中, 没参与本次碰撞的那个颜色”.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:21:#    - 具体小例子: 左侧块发出水平射线 A, 下方块发出竖直射线 B, 右下块发出左上对角线 C.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:30:#      `resolve_*collision` 会错误地把直线射线改写成转弯轨迹.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:35:#    - 三条射线的交点彼此分离, 且不会撞到别的框; 再通过平移和 D4 对称变换增加外观变化.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:36:#    - 网格边长限制在 26-30, 保证模板、边距和足够长的射线都能同时成立.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:38:#    - 解题者在每张图里都能同时看到 3 条原色射线和 3 个混色交点.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/1/code.py:41:#    - 每块只开 1 个缺口, 避免原题那种多射线叠加造成画面杂乱.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:8:#      cols [10,12,14,16,18] and only 4 colored protrusions on the bar.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:9:#    - Exactly 4 consecutive slot columns match the bar's left->right protrusion colors. The matching\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:12:#    - The bar keeps a grey base, while every protrusion has its own visible non-grey color above the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:14:#      aligned protrusion is repainted to that protrusion's color, so the original grey cap disappears.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:18:#         fused task: read the bar's 4 protrusion colors, find the unique consecutive 4-column slot block\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:20:#         the slot top down to the cell just above the protrusion with the protrusion color.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:29:#    - Heights stay in [2,4] so every protrusion exposes at least 1 colored cell above the grey base,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:30:#      making the color-carrying role of the protrusions directly visible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:33:#    - \"The bar is the second-largest grey component\" fails because protrusions are colored; the solver\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:37:#      protrusion color\". Under this exact combo spec the matched slot color and protrusion color are equal,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:41:#      reachable segment above each matched protrusion, absorbing the grey cap.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:48:#    - A human sees 5 slot colors but only 4 colored protrusions, so one frame column must be ignored.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:61:#      the protrusion body, turning each matched column into a single uninterrupted color stripe.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:126:    Insert a colored-projection bar into the frame by color-matching it to one of two candidate slot blocks, then turn the matched columns into solid stripes of the protrusion colors.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:130:    - The left side contains 1 separate bar with a grey base and 4 upward protrusions whose visible cells above the base are colored and mutually distinct.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:134:    - Compare the bar's 4 protrusion colors with the frame's 5 slot-column colors and find the unique consecutive 4-column block with the same left-to-right color order; shift the bar horizontally so each protrusion docks under the same-colored slot column in that block.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:135:    - Clear the original slot colors, keep the inserted bar, and repaint every matched slot column from the slot top down to the cell just above its aligned protrusion using that protrusion's color, eliminating the old grey cap. The unmatched end column disappears.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4c3d4a41/16/code.py:137:    Key insight: Column position alone is insufficient because the frame offers 5 candidates for only 4 protrusions; the solver must first identify the correct color-matched 4-column block, and that same protrusion-color mapping then determines the final full-column repaint.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/26/code.py:16:#    - Combo task: the plus is made asymmetric by a single protruding arm, and that protrusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/26/code.py:26:#      which makes the protrusion cue stable without making shape recognition brittle.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/26/code.py:52:#      perpendicular to the protrusion direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D2/2/code.py:3:# Change: collision_detection——90度交角碰撞时两条射线各转45度并在交叉点留1像素间隙、以单像素绘制；45度... → 碰撞时相互穿过并交换颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:10:#   同时该品红仍向与原端点对隐含对角线垂直的两条对角方向发射射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:20:#   原 `draw_segment()` 默认整条路径都可继续扫描且触发器透明；这里改为沿 L 路径顺序扫描，遇到首个非线色像素就记录射线并 `break`。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:21:#   射线方向仍由蓝端点对所属的原始对角家族决定，而不是由 L 路径的局部水平/竖直方向决定；否则会同时改变另一维规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:24:#   生成器按 output-first 放置。每条真实段先确定端点，再得到完整 L 路径、可见障碍候选与对应射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:25:#   路径、射线、端点、触发器、干扰点都不得重叠；真实段还会保留整条 L 走廊为 `reserved`，这样不会有干扰点落进“被阻断后的空白尾段”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:26:#   障碍射线不得碰到已有结构，也不得穿回自己的 L 路径。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:28:#   真实障碍强制落在竖直腿中段，保证输出里能同时看到完整横臂、部分竖臂、障碍处的两条对角射线，以及障碍后的空白尾段。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:30:#   干扰品红点放在任何真实路径/射线之外，且避免与真实障碍共享对角线，减少把干扰误认成有效分裂器的风险。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/18/code.py:36:#   solver 假设所有真实蓝端点对在对角分组中无歧义，且射线无需覆盖非背景像素；生成器分别用 `_shares_diagonal` 与 `reserved` 检查来保证。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/25/code.py:37:# - 由于“平行延伸 + on-path 触发”意味着射线与主线共线，如果触发点太靠近端点或者端点贴边，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/25/code.py:50:# - 平行延伸与主段共线，旧题里“射线天然不碰主线”的前提不成立；solver 仍需保留\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/25/code.py:55:# - 由于平行单向射线会经过主线内部，所以合法性检查只对 `ray_cells - path_cells`\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/25/code.py:70:# - 段路径、段外可见射线、干扰点彼此不重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/25/code.py:76:# - 为了让单向平行延伸可见，生成器保证至少有一部分射线会越过端点继续进入背景区。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D8/1/code.py:3:# Change: 90度碰撞后轨迹为单像素宽；45度碰撞后轨迹变为2x2像素块（更粗）... → 宽度递增——每次碰撞后射线加宽\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/8/code.py:3:# Name: 矩形框架多方向射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/15/code.py:11:#   - 因此本融合版采用“两阶段”推理：先用 ring 触点枚举候选骨架 path，再用框内 clue 选择正确 path/双色相位，最后把已确定 path 转成角落矩形块、双色棋盘块或整条带。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/15/code.py:13:#     补全整条 L，再把该 L 与左上裁剪边界围出的矩形区域 flood fill；若是双色 L，则整块按相对角点的曼哈顿奇偶扩展成双色块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/15/code.py:21:#   - 原 solver 选择 path 后直接逐点上色；现在 path 只用于匹配 clue 和双色相位，最终渲染改成按区域填充，否则会退化回 D15。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/15/code.py:28:#   - 每个结构使用独立单色或独立双色对；双色只出现在 L 角块上，不把带状区也做成二维双色，避免画面过乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/15/code.py:32:#   - 双色 checker 块的相位仍由 ring 端点颜色约束，clue 只负责在多候选 path 之间打破平局；generator 延续原始交替上色顺序来满足这个前提。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D1 — 射线发射方向 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/0/code.py:3:# Change: 对角线射线（diagonal_ray）——彩色像素通过绿色框架缺口沿45度对角线方向向外发射，方向由缺口相对于内部像素的... → 直线射线（水平/垂直）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/31/code.py:13:#    原题把一对蓝色端点之间整段填成纯蓝, 并把对角线上遇到的品红触发点向垂直对角方向发射纯品红射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/31/code.py:16:#    - 延伸线: 从触发点往外的第一格是 8, 第二格及更远是 1, 因而沿射线会出现 `6, 8, 1, 1, ...`。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/31/code.py:24:#    - 如果不同段或射线重叠, 渐变优先级会变得含糊。生成器因此禁止路径/射线之间的输出重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/31/code.py:26:#    触发点必须离端点至少 2 格, 才能在主路径两侧都看见 8; 同时触发点到四个射线方向的边界距离都至少 2,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/31/code.py:29:#    解题者会在每个训练样例里反复看到同一种局部结构: 主路径靠近品红会变成 8, 射线紧邻品红也是 8,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7491f3cf/21/code.py:3:# Name: cue与面板同色+双色编码\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D1 — 射线发射方向 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D1/1/code.py:3:# Change: 对角线射线（diagonal_ray）——彩色像素通过绿色框架缺口沿45度对角线方向向外发射，方向由缺口相对于内部像素的... → 反射弹跳路径\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/33/code.py:3:# Name: 异形多射线碰撞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/abc82100/4/code.py:42:#       - 对每个 scattered source，沿四个 cardinal 射线找唯一最近 teal，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/40/code.py:3:# Name: 全网格箭头射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:30:#    - That slash line hits an off-segment magenta relay, so a new backslash line appears.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:37:#    seed -> relay -> crossing. This makes the cascade observable without introducing\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:46:#    The generator keeps blue segments disjoint, keeps all chosen trigger/relay cells\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:50:#    magenta relays, and at least one fresh crossing trigger. The output therefore shows\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:54:#    Segment paths are kept disjoint and relay/crossing cells are forced away from segment\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:62:#    - Useful cascades require opposite-orientation rays and later relays; generator\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:215:        \"relay_activation_cells\": set(),\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:229:        elif cause == \"relay\" and (r, c) not in seed_trigger_cells:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:230:            metrics[\"relay_activation_cells\"].add((r, c))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:276:                    enqueue((r, c, emit_orientation, int(g[r, c])), \"relay\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:295:    - Magenta pixels can sit on those blue diagonals as seed triggers, and additional magenta pixels may appear off the diagonals as relays waiting to be hit later.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:342:    relay_a: Coord,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:343:    relay_b: Coord,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:348:    for cell in (seed_a, seed_b, relay_a, relay_b):\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:410:            for relay_a in line_a:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:411:                k_1, _ = _line_constants(relay_a)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:414:                emit_a = set(_full_diagonal_cells(relay_a, 1, H, W))\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:418:                for relay_b in line_b:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:419:                    if relay_b == relay_a:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:421:                    _, s_2 = _line_constants(relay_b)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:427:                    if cross2 in occupied or cross2 in {seed_a, seed_b, relay_a, relay_b, cross0}:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:432:                    inp = _build_candidate_input(H, W, bg, path_a, path_b, seed_a, seed_b, relay_a, relay_b)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/8/code.py:439:                    if len(metrics[\"relay_activation_cells\"]) < 2:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/1/code.py:3:# Name: 对角线渐变射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D14/0/code.py:39:# - For each tree edge, the parent owns the overlap cells and the child adds two red protrusion cells into them. This\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:23:#    - 没有把规则简化成单条射线或单一障碍。每题固定 2 个主要 L 组件，且至少有 1 个组件真的绕障，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:27:#    - 颜色规则保持克制：路径仍是单色或双色交替；障碍统一使用一种专门颜色，避免颜色语义膨胀。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:34:#    - 原双色相位只由端点颜色与整条路径长度决定；在融合后仍先按完整候选最短路确定相位，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:58:#    - 路径颜色规则基本不变：单色为实线，双色按格交替。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/39/code.py:65:#    - 假设双色组件的外部 alternating 轨迹与完整候选最短路奇偶一致；generator 在放置前做兼容性检查。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:14:    original_task: 同色端点确定 45 度对角段；沿段遇到触发色像素时，向垂直对角方向发射双向射线；主段本身会被连续涂色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:17:      - D15/1: 背景改成双色棋盘，只有其中一种背景色属于“可绘制区”；品红射线传播时会穿过另一种背景色但不落笔。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:18:    integration_goal: 解题者既要先从端点和触发点反推一条不可见主对角线，又要从背景纹理判断哪些格子能承接品红射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:25:      - 该主段是反斜杠方向，因此品红射线沿正斜杠方向延伸\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:31:      - 品红射线仍按原几何路线传播，但只有落在 A 背景格上时才着色；落到 B 背景格时保持背景，因此形成规则断续\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:34:      - 原题品红是实线；融合后品红沿同一几何射线呈跳格节奏\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:39:      - 为了保留“棋盘背景”外观且让射线真的出现间断，这里采用 2x2 宏格棋盘，并且只生成反斜杠主段，使垂直射线沿正斜杠方向穿越不同宏格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:40:      - 进一步约束端点/触发点落在同一相位类上，这样每一步射线都会在“可绘制 / 不可绘制”之间交替，断续现象稳定可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:66:      - 端点之间的整条几何路径被预留，不允许与其他段路径、可见射线或干扰像素重叠\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:67:      - 触发器只放在段内部，并筛到能产生可见品红射线的位置\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:85:      - 减少段数和干扰点数量，避免隐藏路径与多束射线叠得过密\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/24/code.py:90:      - 用固定方向主段来换取稳定的射线断续模式，避免有些样例看得出、有些样例看不出的退化情况\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D16/2/code.py:3:# Change: 缺口可以出现在框架的任意一条边的任意位置（角落或边的中间），方向从输入中推断... → 缺口大小编码射线速度\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/3/code.py:3:# Name: 对角线无线索射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/11/code.py:3:# Name: 边缘编码距离射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:9:#     - 原题的主组件把两个框边触点映射成框内单拐角 L 路径；双色时颜色要么逐格交替，要么在单拐角处分段。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:14:#     - 若该组件是双色，外部组件的两端 ring 触点都呈颜色 A，中间外脊呈颜色 B；输出对应为 A-B-A：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:17:#       路径不再是单肘 L，而是双肘 Z/S；双色也不再看步数奇偶，而只看是否跨过两个结构性拐角。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:21:#     - 保留单色/双色两类主组件，但强制每个样例至少 1 个双色组件，避免退化成“只是换了路径形状”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:24:#     - 原 solver 默认双色组件的两个 ring 端点颜色能锚定起止相位；本题不成立，因为 A-B-A 的两个端点同色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:27:#     - 原 generator 的双色外部路径按逐格交替或单拐角切色绘制；若沿用会让输入提示和输出规则错位。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:35:#     - 可见线索有两层：一是输出主路径都出现明显双拐角；二是双色组件的两端同色、中段异色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:41:#     - 双色组件始终只有两种颜色，且变化规则固定为 `A-B-A`，不依赖颜色编号、长度奇偶或组件顺序。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/2/code.py:45:#     - solver 假设双色主组件的 ring 端段颜色是组件主色，另一种颜色只承担中段；generator 统一按该模式着色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D3/0/code.py:3:# Change: continuous_trail——射线沿对角线连续涂色，使用源像素的颜色绘制整条路径... → 周期性颜色图案\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/3/code.py:28:#     - 反射规则只保留一种半透镜语义：每个触发点固定分裂成 4 个对角半射线，不引入二次反射或颜色变化。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/3/code.py:33:#     - 原发射循环隐含“各射线互不影响、顺序不重要”也失效；若继续逐条画到底，先画的射线会不公平地截断后画的射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/37/code.py:3:# Name: 墙壁障碍射线碰撞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D3/2/code.py:3:# Change: continuous_trail——射线沿对角线连续涂色，使用源像素的颜色绘制整条路径... → 碰撞后颜色改变\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:22:#       若任何品红射线击中任意蓝色结构格，该格也输出为 2，而不是保留蓝色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:25:#     - 生成器强制出现三类证据：至少一个 cross-only trigger、至少一个蓝蓝交叉、至少一个蓝线-品红射线交叉。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:30:#     - 原 main() 直接把蓝线写入 out，再让射线只填背景，隐含假设“蓝线-射线交叉保持蓝色”；融合后失效，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:36:#     - 每个对象的合法占位是一个轴对齐正方形的两条对角线；direct/cross 路径、触发器、射线都必须在网格内。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:38:#       射线击中的目标段，确保蓝线-射线交叉存在且不落在端点/trigger 上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:39:#     - cross-only trigger 选在主 X 的新增支线上，并要求它的射线避开受控碰撞区，从而既能证明 D12 行为，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/11/code.py:43:#       特殊色 2 总出现在“线与线”或“线与射线”重合处，而不是随机换色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D12/0/code.py:3:# Change: 输出与输入尺寸相同（same size），射线在原网格上叠加绘制... → 裁剪到射线覆盖区域\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:28:#       指示一种触发色的射线规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:36:#     - 当蓝色对角线补齐时，路径上若碰到绿色像素，就长出一对斜对角射线；若碰到\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:37:#       红色像素，就长出十字形正交射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:43:#   - 只保留两类规则：垂直对角射线、正交十字射线。这样视觉差异足够明显，同时\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:55:#   - 原射线可以画到整张网格；现在左侧图例带是说明区，不允许被主任务输出覆盖，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:62:#   - 每条蓝色对角线都必须整体落在主区域内；其内部补线格与所有射线格都不能与\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/7/code.py:74:#   - 生成器拒绝射线与射线、射线与待补蓝线的重叠，避免输出中心堆成不可读的网。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D7/2/code.py:40:#       the solved output is a relay chain with one terminal piece instead of a star/tree\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D7/2/code.py:57:#       anchor-side junction and one free-end piece; intermediate pieces visibly relay the chain\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D7/2/code.py:141:    Assemble scattered sprites into a relay chain that starts at the yellow anchor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/cbebaa4b/D7/2/code.py:152:    - Continue relaying the open connector forward until all sprites are consumed and every red\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D12/1/code.py:3:# Change: 输出与输入尺寸相同（same size），射线在原网格上叠加绘制... → 仅输出射线轨迹（移除框架）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/17/code.py:18:#      ray direction comes from a one-sided protrusion on the plus-like sprite rather than from the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/17/code.py:23:#      With all rays collapsed in the input, the training pairs must teach both \"protrusion means\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/17/code.py:63:#      support for the \"protrusion encodes direction\" cue.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/19/code.py:40:#    仍保持分散；多配对组件固定单色，避免外部树形连通块再叠加难读的双色相位。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/19/code.py:42:#    双色规则仅保留在单对角块上，端点颜色仍由对应 ring 触点锚定；镜像不改路径顺序，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D12/2/code.py:3:# Change: 输出与输入尺寸相同（same size），射线在原网格上叠加绘制... → 输出扩展到容纳所有完整射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/15/code.py:379:    - The background is the most common color. Active blue objects are 3-cell L-shaped arrows; the degree-2 corner is the tip and the missing diagonal quadrant gives the arrow's facing direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D9/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D9 — 射线宽度 (trajectory)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D9/1/code.py:3:# Change: 射线宽度为2像素（与源方块2x2的边长一致），射线占据2行或2列... → 射线宽度可变（由段长决定）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/28/code.py:16:#     - 颜色也同步变化：原题双色是整条路径交替；这里融合后使用三段三色，且只在两个结构性折点处切色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/28/code.py:21:#     - 每个主组件都强制使用 3 个互异颜色，保证“两个折点切色”是显眼的，而不是偶发退化为单色或双色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/28/code.py:27:#     - 原双色逻辑依赖端点奇偶相位；这里完全失效，因为颜色切换只在两个指定折点发生，与路径长度奇偶无关。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/28/code.py:252:    The outside component carries two visible clues at once: its sideward protrusion fixes where\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:31:#    两种发射形状在 3x3 中占据互补位置，不重叠，所以汇聚后会形成双色实心\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/24/code.py:55:#    3. 中间共享目标会同时收到两种不同颜色、不同形状来源的补形，输出成为双色 3x3。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/39/code.py:3:# Name: 对角多射线源消失\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D19/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D19 — 转弯后射线方向的确定 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D19/1/code.py:3:# Change: 转弯严格为90度——遇到障碍物后射线方向精确转动90度（顺时针或逆时针）... → 转弯角度由碰撞位置决定\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8e5c0c38/D1/0/code.py:62:#       inputs, and asymmetric protrusions are mirrored rather than pruned away.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:44:#   relay assembly with a visible role split and per-edge family labels.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:52:#   therefore show one input side and one output side, which makes the directional relay visible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:53:# - Require at least one internal relay piece whose input family differs from its output family;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:80:# - The solved output is a line-like relay, not a star, so the chaining rule is also visible.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:314:    Assemble scattered sprites into a directed multi-color relay chain rooted at the yellow anchor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:642:    relay_changes = 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:646:            relay_changes += 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/26/code.py:647:    return relay_changes > 0\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8e5c0c38/D1/3/code.py:49:#    Across examples, the solver sees one-sided protrusions jump to the opposite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8e5c0c38/D1/3/code.py:101:    - A few same-color pixels sit on only one side of that axis, acting as one-sided protrusions rather than matched pairs.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/16/code.py:3:# Name: 对角线镜像射线遇障停止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:46:    - 最后画射线的循环现在假设每个方向都附带一个长度；生成器保证所有被选触发点的该长度射线完整在界内，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:49:    - 仍采用 output-first：先挑蓝段，再挑段内触发点，再预留蓝段填充区、真实射线路径和可见空隙。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:59:    - 段数降到 1-3，干扰点数也收紧，并拒绝真实射线、隐藏对侧空白带、蓝段填充之间的任何冲突。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:60:    - 每条短射线后都保留一格背景间隙，终止位置不会贴着边界或别的对象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/9/code.py:66:    - main() 默认有效触发点不会被别的线段共享；生成器通过 reserved 集避免段交叉和射线穿越。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/10/code.py:3:# Name: 障碍物与射线碰撞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D13 — 框架对射线绘制的影响 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/0/code.py:3:# Change: 射线经过框架自身的缺口位置时会在缺口处绘制源颜色像素（替换原来的背景色），框架的绿色边框像素保持不变... → 射线穿过框架时将框架边框重着色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D16/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D16 — 射线与网格边缘的交互 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D16/2/code.py:3:# Change: 射线到达网格边缘时简单终止，不做任何特殊处理... → 射线到达边缘后沿边缘滑行\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/8e5c0c38/D3/2/code.py:40:#    - 轮廓/内部双色分层比随机花纹更稳定，且对象之间通过固定 slot 分开，避免视觉拥挤。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/6/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头射线填充\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/24/code.py:23:#    with a one-cell border ring, and each connector is a two-pixel red protrusion on that ring.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/24/code.py:36:#    2-6, and each connector is always a two-pixel side protrusion. Symmetry is fixed to one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/24/code.py:46:#      red protrusions only in the one-cell border ring.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/24/code.py:153:    assert seen == reds, \"red pixels must be exactly two-pixel side protrusions\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D13 — 框架对射线绘制的影响 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/1/code.py:3:# Change: 射线经过框架自身的缺口位置时会在缺口处绘制源颜色像素（替换原来的背景色），框架的绿色边框像素保持不变... → 射线发射后源框架消失\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/19/code.py:3:# Name: 矩形框架多射线精灵间停止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:13:    - Replace the old tree/radial growth with a simple relay chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:16:      red starts the chain, blue carries the middle relay steps, green closes the chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:29:      after the penultimate relay exposes green, only the green-marked terminal piece may close the chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:49:      from the newest node, otherwise blue middle pieces would not form a relay chain.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:56:      and connector colors that progress from red near the anchor, through blue relay links, to green at closure.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:62:    - Color meaning is coupled to structure: red is always the anchor-adjacent join, blue is always a relay-stage join,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/33/code.py:227:    Reassemble scattered sprites into a color-prioritized relay chain around the fixed yellow anchor.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D13 — 框架对射线绘制的影响 (transform)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D13/2/code.py:3:# Change: 射线经过框架自身的缺口位置时会在缺口处绘制源颜色像素（替换原来的背景色），框架的绿色边框像素保持不变... → 碰撞后射线改变自身框架边框颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/4/code.py:308:#   fails. Only the arrow silhouette's asymmetric protrusion consistently identifies the ray direction.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/1/code.py:26:# - D7/2 effect in pixels: the solved topology is a simple relay chain\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/1/code.py:68:# - The solved outputs visibly form one relay chain with exactly two degree-1 ends: the anchor side and the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/1/code.py:308:    Reassemble scattered sprites into a relay chain by reorienting each piece before it passes the red connection onward.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/1/code.py:320:    Key insight: The state is two-dimensional: you must infer both which sprite comes next in the relay chain and which dihedral orientation makes that sprite's connector pair line up with the single active tail.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/12/code.py:26:#      U-pair 不再只画两条全跨度线, 而是把两线之间的整条带区域填满。双色 L 则扩成保持端点相位的棋盘块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/12/code.py:33:#    - 双色扩张只用于 L 角块, 继续由端点颜色锚定相位, 避免二维传播规则过多。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/12/code.py:41:#    - 双色相位不能依赖颜色 id 排序本身, 只能依赖 ring 端点颜色提示; solver 仍按端点约束反推棋盘块角点颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a6f40cea/12/code.py:52:#    - 单色组件扩成纯色角块/纯色带; 双色组件扩成与路径端点一致的双色棋盘角块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:28:#    - 共享品红点还会在两条线的交叉处生成四向斜射线，样例里能稳定展示“一个点可被多条线同时触发”的现象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:31:#    - 干扰品红点只放在活动对角线和所有输出射线之外，避免看起来像“应该触发却没触发”的伪规律。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:33:#    - 颜色语义仍然只有三类: 背景色、蓝色成段、品红射线；没有新增颜色映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/28/code.py:34:#    - 融合变化完全由几何关系决定: 先最近邻配对，再根据共享触发点所在的每一条线分别贡献垂直射线方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/28/code.py:3:# Name: 源消失仅输出射线区域\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:35:#   sparse chain (seed -> relay -> collision -> re-extension), which makes the fusion visible\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:45:#   repeatedly (blue anchors, magenta propagation). Samples read as a clear zig-zag relay\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:139:        \"relay_hits\": 0,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:190:                    debug[\"relay_hits\"] += 1\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:264:    - The output is not a single two-step construction anymore: magenta pixels relay activation across alternating diagonal directions, and line-line collisions both cap growth and seed the next wave.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/34/code.py:361:        if debug[\"relay_hits\"] < 1:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D18/1/code.py:3:# Change: 无显式图例——所有规则从输入输出对中隐式推断... → 框架内部的颜色图案编码射线行为\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/37/code.py:552:    - The final assembly is valid only if every original red connector is paired exactly once and every reconstructed internal hole is occupied by a neighboring sprite's protrusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D13/0/code.py:15:#    - 保持原题整体版式: 顶部 6x24 图例, 下方主区域, 一个青色 2x2/3x3 方块向四向发射射线.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/11/code.py:20:    - 四条车道颜色保持全异，因此每对交换后的双色分层肉眼可辨，不会因为颜色复用而弱化规则。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/9aaea919/11/code.py:34:    - 人类可以同时看到两层结构线索：哪条红和哪条绿配对，由横向最近的一对一关系决定；配对后每个目标车道都变成“顶部保留目标色 + 底部旧精灵换成源色”的双色分层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 射线终止条件 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/0/code.py:3:# Change: 射线延伸到网格边界或碰到另一条射线的路径时终止... → 固定步数终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/13/code.py:3:# Name: 无线索多射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/23/code.py:19:#     - 被选中的对角线上的品红像素仍像原题一样沿垂直对角方向发射品红射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/23/code.py:39:#     - 触发器只放在被选中的那条对角线内部；射线路径不得碰到任何输入像素，也不得穿过其他对象的保留区。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/23/code.py:46:#     - 品红杂点不进入这些正方形；射线也不会撞入其他对象区域，避免多层覆盖导致对象边界难辨。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 射线终止条件 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:3:# Change: 射线延伸到网格边界或碰到另一条射线的路径时终止... → 碰到任意前景像素即停止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:10:#       - 边框上的背景缺口是射线起点；缺口在边上时发射水平/垂直射线，在角上时发射对角射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:13:#       - 原题在“射线遇到别的射线”时会触发 45/90 度碰撞、转向、锯齿和空洞。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:14:#       - 本变体取消这些后续动力学；射线现在只会直行，并且下一个像素只要不是背景就立即停下。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:15:#       - 障碍物范围扩大为：其他框架边框、其他框架内部 2x2 色块、已经画出的射线路径，以及同步一步里被多条射线争抢的同一空白格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:18:#       - 原逻辑：生成器必须避免这种布局，因为射线撞到框架会触发 solver 断言；若改成两条射线相撞，则会继续转向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:19:#       - 新逻辑：左射线会涂色“缺口 + 两个背景格”，然后在右框左侧墙像素前停止，不会发生转向或继续传播。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:22:#     - 如果 generator 继续使用原题的“所有射线都只会穿过背景”的约束，这个 D6 改动几乎不可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:23:#     - 因此样例里必须稳定出现“射线被已有前景提前截断”的情况。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:25:#       这样每个块颜色只对应一条射线，观察者不需要分辨同色多束射线之间的关系。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:30:#     - 原 generator 依赖“射线绝不会碰到框架/色块”；D6 反而需要主动制造这种情况。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:33:#     - generator 先放一个强制成对布局：两框水平或垂直对齐，并保证一条射线在至少 2 格背景后撞到对方框架。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:34:#     - 其余框随机放置，但其射线路径必须与已有路径集合不相交，避免动态遮挡把样例变乱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:36:#     - 每个样例至少有 1 条射线在到达边界前被前景截断，这个是 D6 的定量可见证据。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:37:#     - 因为每个块颜色唯一、每块只发 1 条射线，所以人眼可以直接把“某个颜色块”和“它那条被截断的射线”对应起来。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:42:#     - 不做任何颜色映射；射线颜色仍等于对应 2x2 内块颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:43:#     - 颜色只承担“绑定哪条射线属于哪个块”的作用，没有不可见排序或 id 依赖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/1/code.py:46:#     - solver 对同时争抢同一空白格的多条射线采用“全停且不落格”的同步规则；generator 额外构造路径互斥，避免样例长期依赖这个次要分支。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/22/code.py:3:# Name: 多射线碰撞按距离排序\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/53fb4810/30/code.py:3:# Name: 多色精灵干扰射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D18/2/code.py:3:# Change: 源方块固定为青色(8)，颜色仅作为标识不编码额外信息，射线也涂青色... → 多色源方块（内部图案）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/6/code.py:268:    - bg = most common color. Blue source objects are 3-cell L-shaped arrows whose corner cell is the tip and whose missing quadrant gives the forward diagonal.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/3/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 射线终止条件 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/3/code.py:3:# Change: 射线延伸到网格边界或碰到另一条射线的路径时终止... → 射线填充整条对角线直到两侧边界\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 射线终止条件 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:3:# Change: 射线遇到障碍物时转弯继续，最终在到达网格边缘时终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/0/code.py:4:#   → 遇到另一条射线轨迹时终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 射线终止条件 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D6/2/code.py:3:# Change: 射线延伸到网格边界或碰到另一条射线的路径时终止... → 到达目标标记像素终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:8:#     - 原题只有一种真实触发色：蓝色端点先连成 45 度主对角线，主线经过的品红像素再沿垂直对角方向发射两条斜向射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:10:#       品红 6 仍发射垂直对角射线，红色 2 改为发射上下左右四向正交射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:14:#       原题输出只有蓝线和品红斜射线；融合后还会多出红色十字分支，并把两个触发点和中心等交叉格统一涂成黄色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:18:#     - 正交射线覆盖面积大，因此生成器不追求很多线段，而是固定生成两条相交主线和两个真实触发器，降低冲突并保持画面可读。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/db695cfb/14/code.py:28:#     - 任意射线都不得穿过任何输入像素（端点、另一个触发器、干扰点），否则 solver 的“只填背景”会留下难解释的断裂。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D6 — 射线终止条件 (dst)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D6/2/code.py:3:# Change: 射线遇到障碍物时转弯继续，最终在到达网格边缘时终止... → 遇到特定颜色障碍物时终止（不转弯）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D14 — 多步处理与射线顺序 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/0/code.py:3:# Change: 所有射线同时发射并独立延伸，碰撞在轨迹交叉时自然发生（无显式顺序）... → 按框架距离排序处理\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D14 — 多步处理与射线顺序 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/0/code.py:3:# Change: 所有射线从源方块同时向4个方向发射，各自独立追踪路径直到离开网格，无射线间顺序依赖... → 按方向顺序依次发射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D14 — 多步处理与射线顺序 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:3:# Change: 所有射线同时发射并独立延伸，碰撞在轨迹交叉时自然发生（无显式顺序）... → 迭代碰撞——碰撞后的新方向射线可再次碰撞\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:16:#     - 输入外观仍是原题的 4x4 框 + 内部 2x2 单色块；缺口继续决定射线起点和初始方向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:17:#     - 输出里最重要的新现象不是新颜色，而是“同一束射线的多次折向”：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:18:#       射线不再全局同步起跑，而是按框/缺口的读取顺序逐束启动；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:19:#       一次碰撞后形成的新方向会获得局部优先级，先连续推进，直到撞上第三束射线或到边界。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:33:#     - 原 cell collision 依赖 owner cell 代表“历史上已画出的射线路径”；新变体仍成立，因为暂停射线会保留\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:36:#     - 生成器让三个核心框保持 >=2 格框间距，且所有射线初段都只穿过背景。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D14/2/code.py:46:#     - 颜色语义不变：射线颜色仍等于内块颜色。变体只改时序，所以无需额外颜色映射学习负担。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/39/code.py:44:# - The child in each tree edge contributes red protrusions into the parent-owned cells, so every sprite\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:34:#   token centers are exactly 2 cells from wire endpoints; each relay center touches at most two\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:35:#   bands (one above, one below); after excluding the incoming endpoint, a relay has at most one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:454:      then the relay X uses a different permutation in the next band.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:465:    relay_tokens: dict[int, int] = {\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:472:    elif relay_tokens:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:480:    relay_tokens = {col: color for col, color in relay_tokens.items() if col in ch_cols}\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:485:        relay_tokens[ch_cols[mid_idx]] = color\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a47bf94d/12/code.py:487:    for mid_col, color in relay_tokens.items():\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D14 — 多步处理与射线顺序 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D14/1/code.py:3:# Change: 所有射线从源方块同时向4个方向发射，各自独立追踪路径直到离开网格，无射线间顺序依赖... → 链式反应传播\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D10/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D10 — 射线发射方向与缺口位置的映射 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D10/1/code.py:3:# Change: 缺口在框架的某条边上时，射线向该方向的对角线发射——缺口方向与射线方向严格对应... → 缺口方向决定水平/垂直分量，内部色块位置决定另一分量\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D10/1/code.py:3:# Change: 移除顶部6行图例区域，输出为紧密裁剪后的主区域（tight_crop），输出尺寸 = 输入行数-6 x 原列数... → 裁剪到射线轨迹的最小外接矩形\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D11/2/code.py:3:# Change: 多个框架（1-5个），每个框架独立发射一条射线，射线之间可能碰撞（多源独立发射模型）... → 链式传递——射线到达下一个框架后触发该框架发射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D11/2/code.py:59:# - main() assumes: one source frame, all other frames are 2-gap relays, every emitted segment either reaches\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D11/2/code.py:60:#   the next frame's gap or leaves the grid, and relay segments do not overlap previous ones.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D11/2/code.py:287:                assert out[nxt[0], nxt[1]] == bg, \"relay entry gaps should be untouched before activation\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D11/2/code.py:306:        assert len(frames[next_frame][\"gaps\"]) == 2, \"every non-source frame must be a 2-gap relay\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D11/2/code.py:314:# --------------- generator (d11_chain_relay) ---------------\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D11 — 障碍物对射线的阻挡行为 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:3:# Change: 射线碰到障碍物边缘时立即转弯，障碍物完全阻挡射线不让穿过... → 半透明障碍物（射线穿透后转弯）\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:20:#     - 变化只发生在输出路径上：青色方块射线第一次碰到障碍时不转弯，而是继续直行穿过该同色矩形。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:21:#     - 射线在障碍内部经过的 footprint 也会涂成青色；直到它穿过障碍并到达另一侧紧邻的出口格，才按照图例转向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:24:#     - 例如 sz=2，向北射线的下一步 top-left 从 r=8 到 r=7 时第一次碰到位于 rows 4..6 的障碍。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/0/code.py:26:#     - 新规则：射线依次占据 r=7,6,5,4 这些与障碍相交的位置，并把这些位置刷成青色；随后再前进一步到出口 r=3，并在这个出口格转向。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/27/code.py:3:# Name: 双向射线无分隔裁剪\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/27/code.py:51:  2. 在完整画布上执行双向射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/27/code.py:53:- 新假设：清除 bar 本体时，bar 只来自输入解析出的那些连续段，而不是由后续射线新增。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/27/code.py:84:- 若该值为 0，则在裁剪并清除 bars 后，双向射线在 bar_side 上没有留下任何可见结果，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/34/code.py:20:#      1. motif 从单色变成双色连通精灵：主色 = 某个方块色，第二色 = 固定标记色 2。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/34/code.py:29:#    - 差异由三部分共同构成：图例控制“放哪儿”，双色 motif 提供“染成什么”，棋盘筛选控制“哪些块生效”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/34/code.py:47:#      2. 每个有效 motif 是一个 bbox 不超过 3x3 的双色连通组件，且只包含一个块色和标记色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/34/code.py:53:#    - motif 仍落在 3x3 槽位中，槽位间距 1；双色只是对同一连通 footprint 局部换色，不改变占位。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/58f5dbd5/34/code.py:62:#    - 干扰 motif 也采用同样的双色样式，因此视觉语法一致，但颜色不匹配时不会被用到。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:3:# Change: 所有框架使用统一的绿色(3)作为边框颜色，框架本身不阻挡其他射线... → 框架作为射线障碍物\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:15:#     - 缺口仍然是边框上的背景色像素，仍然负责发射射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:17:#     - 射线撞到别的框边时不再触发原版的 assert/非法布局；它会依据入射方式停止或反弹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:27:#     - 差异本质：框从单纯射线源变成“源 + 障碍物”，影响点正是在 proposal 里对非背景下一步的解释。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:31:#       这样 2-3 组样例里人眼就能看到“绿色边框会挡住/折返射线”，不会被随机性淹没。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:32:#     - 仍保留原始射线-射线碰撞引擎，因此 D7 之外的核心机制未被删改。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:36:#     - 原代码允许走进已经上色但输入里是背景的格子，用于处理射线间碰撞；这个前提仍成立。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:37:#       因此新逻辑不能把 `cell_owner` 当成 obstacle，只需要阻止射线走回自己已画过的轨迹。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:43:#     - 反弹源与停止源的射线都要求在撞框前至少穿过 2 个背景格，保证事件可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e12f9a14/D7/1/code.py:46:#     - 其他额外射线被压到最低：每框只开一个缺口，减少覆盖层次，保持画面整洁。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D11 — 障碍物对射线的阻挡行为 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/e87109e9/D11/1/code.py:3:# Change: 射线碰到障碍物边缘时立即转弯，障碍物完全阻挡射线不让穿过... → 障碍物颜色决定阻挡vs通过\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/33/code.py:3:# Name: 单像素有限射线延迟起始\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:12:#    单像素目标”的局部对象；输出因此变成多条同色射线汇聚到异色点，并继续在 seed->target\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:13:#    的偏移下复制一层异色平行射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:24:#      单像素异色目标本身不扩展，否则会产生额外反向射线并使颜色覆盖顺序变得脆弱。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:31:#      一个 seed 顶点与目标异色像素 8 邻接，且至少还有一条非共线主射线，使复制层可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:34:#    patch 的 bbox 覆盖了主射线和可能出现的平行射线，因此放置时不会截断。全局仍保留 >=1 的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:41:#    生成器只选互异方向的射线，避免大量共享主干；另外要求至少一条非共线射线能复制出异色平行\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:45:#    是“最近终点/复制色”。同一网格里会重复出现多个这样的双色对象，足以支撑归纳。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/3/code.py:50:#    - 至少一条主射线与 seed 偏移不共线，使第二阶段复制真正发生。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/3/code.py:18:#     - 仍然是“内部双色/多色 sprite + 边界孤立 anchor”的原题骨架，marker 色匹配 anchor 色，anchor 边决定水平/垂直滑动轴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/4/code.py:306:    Assemble scattered sprites into a single relay chain whose color groups must alternate.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/4/code.py:316:    - Keep relaying the tail forward until all sprites are consumed and the last sprite closes the chain with no unused port left.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:4:#   -> 距离编码停止：方向仍由“下一个同色顶点”给出，但射线只走固定步数；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:16:#       设该颜色在输入中的像素数为 n，则每条射线只从起点沿该方向前进 n 步。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:17:#       输出保留所有原始顶点，所以当真实目标顶点更远时，会看到“射线停在半途 + 远处仍有同色点”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:23:#       右上等顶点仍以孤立输入点形式保留。阴影只沿这些“截断射线”平移复制。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:35:#       - 阴影阶段原来平移完整边；现在必须平移截断后的射线，否则会错误延伸到旧终点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:36:#       - len(cycle)==2 时原题只有一条边；新题仍保持这一点，否则会把 2 点对象变成双向射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:39:#       - generator 必须保证截断射线和其平移阴影在输入中途不撞上非背景像素，否则 solver 会合法地跳过该射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:43:#       输入顶点、主射线、可选阴影锚点、以及阴影射线。全局放置仍使用 random_free_location，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:47:#       人类可直接数出某颜色输入像素个数 n，并观察该颜色所有输出射线都只延伸 n 步；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D8/2/code.py:52:#       - 只生成边长足够长的 2/3/4 顶点形状，避免大量重叠或过短射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/11/code.py:10:#    - 保留原题对象类型：边界孤立锚点、内部双色精灵、少数色 marker、按锚点所在边决定滑动轴。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/3/code.py:3:# Name: 对角线射线有限弹药\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/cbebaa4b/5/code.py:49:#   cells as a protrusion; therefore the only overlaps are still exactly the two red cells.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/eee78d87/D2/1/code.py:3:# Change: 4种固定的3x3轮廓字形：plus(.#./#11/.#.)、H(#.#/###/#.#)、X(#.#/.#./#.#)... → 字形使用双色编码\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/32/code.py:24:#   本融合版先把两条射线的中心点改成对角线：近条中心是 (r+1,6),(r+3,8),(r+5,10)...，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/32/code.py:52:# - 2-4 组样例里，人能直接看到三个稳定信号：射线沿斜线下行、每个周期不是单点而是小十字、重叠处形成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/10/code.py:19:#    则两束射线会在中间区相遇并竞争同一批格子。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/17/code.py:17:# - 变化 1（D4/0）：某条 bar 的周期射线如果下一次正好落到障碍物，就在该障碍处停止，障碍本身保持原色且不可覆盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/23/code.py:3:# Name: 水平分隔垂直射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/2/code.py:3:# Name: 宽涂射线遇障碍停止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/2/code.py:19:# - 连续段不是整块写入，而是按射线方向逐格扫描：若遇到障碍色，则当前段立刻在障碍前截断，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/2/code.py:20:#   且这条 bar 的后续周期事件全部停止；非障碍但已上色的格子只跳过，不会中断射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D3/3/code.py:23:# - 因此 generator 收紧到 4 或 6 顶点的辐射对象，方向来自 8 邻域中的 2 或 3 对对向射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/35ab12c3/D3/3/code.py:38:# - 由于每条 spoke 都是独立射线，局部 occupied cells 可精确计算，bbox 也可精确包含 shape + shadow。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/28/code.py:3:# Name: 水平分隔垂直色条垂直射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/1ae2feb7/12/code.py:3:# Name: 双向密集射线冲突留白\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D1/2/code.py:60:#       且容器各自只需要找自己四侧射线上的最近整边直线即可\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/271d71e2/D1/2/code.py:66:#     - 候选线与容器整边严格对齐，solver 才能用“沿四条射线找最近整边 9 线”的方式匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/581f7754/23/code.py:38:#     - component_marker_color 仍依赖 marker 是组件内最少颜色；生成器继续构造单 marker 的双色精灵。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/25/code.py:31:#      个单元; 如果青色射线是向上/向下撞到红障碍, 就按顺时针转; 如果是向左/向右撞到同色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/25/code.py:51:#      被至少一条射线命中, 且总命中数仍保持 4-5, 每束最多 2 次碰撞.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/26/code.py:20:#     - 主区域仍有唯一的青色实心方块，射线仍以 sz x sz 的滑动方块形式沿四个基方向发出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/26/code.py:24:#     - 左右两侧背景带中的障碍遵循 D11：射线先穿透整个障碍，在远侧出口格现身后才按图例转弯。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/26/code.py:25:#     - 中间背景带中的障碍改为“完全阻挡”：射线在第一次接触该障碍前就终止，不进入也不转弯。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/26/code.py:29:#     - 设 sz=2，主区域被切成 8|8|8 三个竖带。北向射线在中带撞上横向障碍：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/26/code.py:31:#     - 同时，东向射线在右带撞上同色或异色竖向障碍：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/3/code.py:3:# Name: 链式射线颜色渐变\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/11/code.py:3:# Name: 边缘反弹加射线碰撞终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/29/code.py:30:#       然后对每个精灵，把这条线视作“可穿透门”，从门两端恢复边界射线，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/29/code.py:36:#     - 保留原题的锯齿臂、两类射线斜率、阴影机制，所以仍属于同一视觉家族。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/33/code.py:9:#    - 融合后每个真实 sprite 都是双色对象：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/33/code.py:18:#      3. 在 hub 外找包含颜色 7 的双色组件；读取该组件哪个 bbox 角落是 7：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/33/code.py:21:#         若是，则整只双色 sprite 贴到 top，内部装饰色一起保留。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/33/code.py:25:#      3. 粘贴时不再只保留单色块，而是保留壳色与内层装饰色的完整双色对象。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/18/code.py:3:# Name: 像素数编码射线长度+距离编码终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:3:# Name: 方块位于角落+直线射线可达性\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:17:#     - D1/0 把“可达”改成“视线首阻挡”：从 3x3 方块四边外侧的 12 个位置分别向外发射水平/竖直射线，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:18:#       射线只穿过橙地板，遇到第一个非地板像素就停止；只有该首个阻挡像素是栗色时，它才会被吸入目标块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:21:#       因而 12 条射线长度高度不对称，输入看起来像“角落里的观察口”而不是居中的房间。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:24:#       向上射线最多只能看见 1 格后撞墙，向左射线立即撞墙；向下 / 向右则能沿长走廊继续扫描。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:30:#     - 如果把方块完全贴死在角落，两侧射线会直接失效，最多只剩 6 个候选，容易让“距离排序/截断到 9”失去作用。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:32:#       这样仍能看出明显角落偏置，同时不少样例保留 10-12 条可用射线，排序和 `>9` 截断仍会真实发生。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:33:#     - 另外，生成器稳定加入至少一枚“旧 BFS 可达、但新射线不可见”的室内栗色；并在部分射线上放置被前景遮挡的深层栗色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:36:#     - 原 solver 的核心假设“可达性=4 连通连通性”失效，必须改成逐射线扫描首个非地板像素。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:37:#     - 原 solver 允许栗色充当 BFS 通道；在本题里栗色恰恰必须终止视线，否则会退化成“同一射线整串都可见”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:46:#     - 所有“可见源”都放在某条射线的室内地板段上；所有“BFS-only 诱饵”都放在同一房间内但避开全部射线格；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/42/code.py:52:#       框内诱饵与射线候选通过几何位置分离，视觉上不混杂。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/3/code.py:28:#     the matching 4-bit protrusion row/col backed by a solid support band.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/3/code.py:44:#     a filled protrusion at that slot. These patterns are pairwise distinct and\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/3/code.py:60:#            - the adjacent protrusion lane equals that side's notch pattern\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/3/code.py:75:#     every sample, so humans can infer \"notch <-> protrusion complement\" from\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/65b59efc/D5/1/code.py:3:# Change: 单色重绘 -> 双色重绘\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/31/code.py:84:#    with one side segment removed and no extra protrusions. The generator constructs exactly\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/11/code.py:11:#     - D4/0 改动：sprite 不再是单色，而是双色。外层色 = 某条 hub 边颜色；内层色 =\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/11/code.py:12:#       一个非 hub 边色。输出贴附时保留整只双色对象，不能只搬运外层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/11/code.py:33:#         1) 先对 hub 外全部前景做 8 连通分块，拿到整只双色组件。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/11/code.py:72:#         * 贴回去的是整只双色对象，而不是只保留外壳；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/40/code.py:15:#   - 与原题不同，射线现在按上→右→下→左依次发射；每束都是 sz x sz 的滑动方块。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/40/code.py:17:#       1. 上射线先撞到北侧横条 A。原题会在 A 的近侧立即转弯；本变体会穿过 A，并把整块 A 都重涂成青色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/40/code.py:19:#       2. 这束上射线再撞到西侧竖条 B，同样先整块重涂 B，再穿过后于远侧左出口转弯向下。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/40/code.py:21:#       4. 之后轮到下射线；它撞到的 C 已不是原色，而是青色，所以不能再查图例。这里固定约定：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/40/code.py:23:#       5. 最后左射线撞到已被上射线染青的 B，也按“青色障碍 = 穿透后顺时针”处理。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/4/code.py:44:#    - 输出里唯一变化仍是某一根 bar 的内部被涂成 cap 色，颜色映射线索完全由“图例色=端点色”给出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/39/code.py:3:# Name: 双向射线加源色编码方向\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/11/code.py:33:# - 差异点因此有两层：先看 legend 的双色有序对去分组，再在厚帽 bar 中只度量两帽之间的\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/11/code.py:34:#   fill 长度做排序，最后把选中 fill 重绘成对应的双色分层。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/11/code.py:46:#   两行双色 token 的水平重复，必须改成按“同一颜色对连续出现多少列”来读 rank。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/11/code.py:50:# - 原 solver 直接把 fill 全部刷成单个 cap 色；这里也不够了，因为 legend 提供的是双色对。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/11/code.py:66:# - 人类能直接看到 legend 不再是单色竖块，而是“两行双色、宽度代表 rank”的条目。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/11/code.py:67:# - bars 也显然不是原题单列细条，而是 2 列宽、上下厚帽的对象；选中后 fill 出现上下双色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/7/code.py:25:#      但在任何旋转、任何边上都无法形成“support 带全满 + protrusion 带等于该边凹口”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/28/code.py:10:#    - 例子: 顶边某处出现一个高 3 的双色小矩形, 左列为蓝, 右列为红。则在所有帽色=蓝的条中找到第 3 长的那根,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/28/code.py:14:#    - 图例项数量仍与条组数量一致(1-4 组), 且所有图例都复用统一的双色矩形模板, 人类可以从少量样例中看到重复模式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/28/code.py:27:#    - 解题者能先在上边缘找到分散的双色矩形, 再用左列颜色匹配对应条组, 再用矩形高度决定“第几长”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/28/code.py:37:#    - 假设每个图例项都是高度 1-3、宽度 2 的实心双色矩形; 生成器严格按此模板构造。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/28/code.py:39:#    - 假设目标色 T 与帽色 K、原填充色 F 都不同; 生成器从剩余颜色池挑选 F, 并令图例双色全局互异。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/35/code.py:31:#           protrusion row = 1000\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/35/code.py:40:#      “底部一整条 support 带 + 最左一格 protrusion”。其它同色组件要么\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/35/code.py:41:#      protrusion 位置不对，要么 support 带不完整，要么多个旋转都不唯一。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/15/code.py:46:#    - 原 `_legend_entries` 依赖“单色连通块高度 == 排名”；融合后 legend 是重复的双色 token，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/15/code.py:61:#    - 输入里能直接看到：上方是若干重复的双色 token，下方 bars 的端点颜色却是另一套颜色，说明 legend 颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/97d7923e/15/code.py:75:#    - 每个组被选中的目标 bar 内部长度 >= 2；这不是 solver 必需条件，但 generator 强制它以便双色输出可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/9/code.py:3:# Name: 双向射线加终止颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/38/code.py:22:#         plus one protrusion band whose 4-bit silhouette matches that side's notch\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/38/code.py:28:#      have a full 4-cell support row just inside the hub and a bottom protrusion row\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/38/code.py:64:#      protrusion mouths.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:3:# Name: 直线射线可达性+规则矩形框架\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:17:#     - 把“可达性”从 BFS 连通改成 12 条水平/垂直直线射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:21:#     - 射线起点不是任意地板，而是 12 个“边中点位”：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:23:#     - 若 (3,5) 是开口、(2,5) 是地板、(1,5) 是栗色，则向上的射线会命中 (1,5)，它可移动。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:25:#       现在射线只检查 column 5，所以它保持不动。这就是融合后的关键差异。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:27:#       这体现“哪些开口允许哪条射线射出”的框架维度。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:35:#     - 原 main 依赖 `passable={floor,9}` 和 BFS 距离矩阵；融合后这两点都失效，必须改为逐射线扫描。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:43:#     - 射线一旦遇到栗色就停止，因此一条射线上最多只有最靠内的那颗会参与排序；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:44:#       生成器据此避免把 BFS-only 诱饵放到开口射线的净空通道上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:48:#     - visible 源只放在各自开口向外的同一直线上；BFS-only 诱饵只放在框外、且不位于任何开口射线的格子上；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/dd6b8c4b/2/code.py:49:#       blocked-line 诱饵只放在封死射线外侧的同线格子上。三类位置互不重叠。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/20/code.py:9:#     原题按“单色 + 4个旋转”处理。这里改成“双色复合精灵 + 8个二面体变换”：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/20/code.py:27:#     若内层颜色完全自由，镜像后可能也合法，8 变换会产生歧义；若把整只双色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/20/code.py:46:#       - 所有匹配/干扰物都由同一小模板族生成，保持 8 连通且双色可见；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/20/code.py:52:#     人眼能直接看到三点：一是散落精灵与贴附精灵都是双色整只对象，而不是只剩外壳；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:33:    \"name\": \"链式射线颜色渐变\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:58:    \"name\": \"单像素源加细射线\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:104:    \"name\": \"双向射线加终止颜色\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:130:    \"name\": \"边缘反弹加射线碰撞终止\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:279:    \"name\": \"环绕网格加链式射线\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/_logs/launch_meta.json:488:    \"name\": \"双向射线加源色编码方向\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/36/code.py:27:#         Real sprites have a 2-row / 2-col contact mouth whose protrusion pattern is\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/36/code.py:54:#      one-cell protrusion\" can attach there; a bigger same-color blob is ignored.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:30:#    - 由端点射出两条斜边的几何失效: 现在应由每个缺口两侧的墙尖端分别发射平行射线，形成多条独立带区。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:36:#    射线必定能打到边界。障碍只放在背景上，且与墙保持距离，不与缺口粘连。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:43:#    开口总数固定为 2，且桥缺口与弧缺口分属不同部位，能避免大量射线互相交叉。外部填充被两条平行\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/38/code.py:44:#    边界射线约束成干净的窄带，不会演化成整片外部背景被全部染色。障碍仍是少量孤立像素，视觉层次\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/40/code.py:3:# Name: 最大色块触发+像素数编码射线长度\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/5/code.py:3:# Name: 单像素源加细射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:24:  每个缺口各自发出一条轴对齐的带状射线; 因此输出会同时在上边界和左边界看到填充色抵达。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/2/code.py:67:- `_apply_opening_fill()` 假设每个缺口都对应一条轴对齐外射线: generator 只使用 top/bottom/left/right 缺口。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/25/code.py:47:#     - legend 是两个颜色重叠得到的小双色 glyph。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/e87109e9/23/code.py:3:# Name: 环绕网格加链式射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:19:#      line carries a same-colored protrusion mask;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:21:#      on each active side must equal the frame protrusion mask on that side;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:30:#      mask equals the top protrusion comb and whose left-hole mask equals the left protrusion comb.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:32:#    - integration detail: because D1 uses the second row/column for protrusions, the D5 copy target\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:49:#    - Naively reusing the D5 corner target `(1,1)` would overwrite D1 protrusions on row/col 1; the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:57:#    - The frame protrusion masks are kept away from the literal corner, so the two control colors never\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:58:#      overwrite each other and the copied core does not overlap the protrusion lane.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:63:#    - The protrusion lane remains visible in the output because the corner copy is offset inward; this\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:315:    2. Read the inner protrusion masks on those two sides.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/8/code.py:316:    3. Find the unique dihedral transform whose object-side hole masks equal those protrusion masks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/27/code.py:23:#      - 原 solver 用“双色紧凑重叠块 + 哪个颜色面积更大”去解 legend，这在融合后完全失效，必须改成识别 2 行高、双色、不含背景、\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/27/code.py:48:#       2. 是高 2、宽为偶数的纯双色不透明矩形；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/54/code.py:20:#       - 仍是大面积重复的 3x3 双色对称图案，作为稳定背景。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b99e7126/54/code.py:22:#       - 仍是另一种 3x3 双色图案；其高频色定义 3x3 active mask。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:11:# - 融合后，精灵变成“外壳色 + 内芯色”的双色复合对象，且轮廓完全非对称。匹配时\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:21:#   找到后，把整只双色对象贴到 hub 左边，黄色内芯原样保留。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:26:# - 若允许任意双色非对称自由形状，很容易出现两个问题：\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:33:#   4. 每只精灵恰好双色，内芯色从非 hub 边色的小调色板重复取值，形成重复支撑。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:58:#   1. 贴上 hub 的不是单色块，而是双色整组件；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:66:#   干扰物若存在也用同一家族的小双色非对称形状，但外壳色不在 hub 边色里。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:76:# - `vals = {arr[mask]}` 之后检查 `outer_color in vals and len(vals) >= 2`，假设匹配精灵是双色；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/2c181942/34/code.py:77:#   生成器强制每个可匹配精灵恰好双色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/8/code.py:45:#     - 颜色重着色仍由框外双色图例给出；为减少歧义，生成器让目标色彼此不同且不复用源色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/7/code.py:3:# Name: 多色模板+双色语义分离\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:15:#    border colors, but the inner line next to each active frame side also carries a protrusion\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:17:#    guide masks exactly match those frame protrusion masks, then peel off the guide cells seen\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:22:#    positions as the top frame protrusions, and likewise for the left frontier. Near the notch,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:44:#    protrusions are painted on the inner border line and the object is placed with `border=1`,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:49:#    directions, and the frame carries matching comb-like protrusions on one horizontal plus one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:54:#    the border/protrusions only. Internal pattern colors stay inside the core. This avoids heavy\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:247:    Align a non-rectangular object by matching guide-hole signatures to frame protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/1/code.py:251:    the one whose directional frontier guide mask matches the two frame protrusion masks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:21:      - 框外 sprite 变成双色 patch，主色面积更大、次色面积更小\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:22:      - 占位块仍然只用主色匹配 sprite；复制时保留整个双色图案\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:39:    - 原 solver 用单色连通分量按颜色收集 sprite；融合后这会把双色 sprite 拆碎，因此必须先排除 legend，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:40:      再在整体非背景掩码上按 4 连通提取完整双色 patch\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:44:    - legend 检测仍沿用“紧凑、无背景、双色、bbox 相互重叠”的思路；生成器保证双色 sprite 的 bbox 中保留背景孔洞，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:50:    - 每个占位色都保证恰有一个同尺寸双色 sprite；legend 只放严格子集，不影响 sprite 唯一匹配\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:52:    - 输入里能直接看到：框外有双色 sprite，但只有部分主色拥有图例块\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:57:    - 每个双色 sprite 都是一个完整的 4 连通 patch，且主色唯一占优\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/24/code.py:59:    - legend 若存在，仍是原题 3x4 固定双色块\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/19/code.py:21:#     融合后先用同一组端点射线与 BFS 找到所有可达背景格，但位于开口内侧的一部分只保留“4 邻接墙体”的那些格。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/19/code.py:24:#   - 保留四个基向开口方向以及 1:1 / 1:2 两种端点射线模式，避免变体退化成单朝向模板题。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D9/1/code.py:18:#    - 画面仍是 30x24：底部 2-3 条整行横条，顶部是若干双色或单色小精灵。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D9/1/code.py:34:#    - 顶部模式提取逻辑按“颜色连通块 + bbox”工作；这会把双色精灵的内层块也当成独立模式。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/17/code.py:3:# Name: 遮罩双色填充+嵌套框架模板\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/4/code.py:3:# Name: 周期性颜色+开口宽度射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:14:#      carries a comb-like protrusion mask. The mask is the real orientation clue.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:18:#      placed only on the positions selected by the protrusion masks. From a side view, \"frontier touches bbox edge\"\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:20:#    - The solver must find the dihedral transform whose two 1D boundary-touch masks match the frame protrusion masks,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:43:#    - Frame protrusions live on the inner border line and are kept away from corners so the two control channels do not\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:46:#    - Inputs visibly show a frame with one horizontal and one vertical control side, plus inward protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:53:#    - Only two guide mechanisms are shown at once: frame protrusions and one shared object-guide color. This avoids\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:59:#    - `_frame_signature()` assumes the active inner protrusions form one contiguous span with at least two holes.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:280:    Align the central object by matching guide-hole silhouettes to frame protrusion masks,\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/34/code.py:526:        raise ValueError(\"frame too small for protrusion signatures\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/5/code.py:3:# Name: 射线长度等于填充面积+像素计数终止\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/65b59efc/_shared.py:32:    \"D5/1\": \"双色重绘\",\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/28/code.py:3:# Name: 仅输出射线区域+无孤立像素\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/edb79dae/16/code.py:35:#     - 图例仍是紧凑双色无背景重叠块；空心精灵因自身 bbox 中含背景洞，不会被误判成图例。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:12:#      while the frame exposes matching same-colored protrusion masks on the inner line of each active side.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:15:#    - fused rule: \"find that the frame activates the vertical axis (top/bottom); read the top and bottom protrusion masks;\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:17:#      corresponding frame protrusion mask; then crop those two guide rows\".\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:37:#    Frame protrusions sit on the inner line next to the active border and stay away from corners, so they do not collide\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:41:#    A human sees two opposite colored border controls and matching comb-like protrusions facing inward. The object shows\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:45:#    Only three structural layers occupy the scene: frame borders, inner protrusion masks, and one central object.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/6/code.py:216:    Each active side exposes an inward protrusion mask; the matching object side is the one\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D3/0/code.py:3:# Change: 双色精灵：外层色（多数像素）包裹内层色（少数像素，可选），2x2到5x9尺寸，左右对称，在顶部区域互不重叠... → 三色精灵\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:10:#    active frame side owns a same-colored inward protrusion mask on the adjacent inner line. The object also has\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:13:#    protrusion masks on the same sides, then crop the matched guide layer, then apply one extra reflection to the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:35:#    `paste`. The frame protrusions live on the inner border line of the active sides only; the object is placed with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:36:#    `border=1`, so it cannot overlap the frame controls or their protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:40:#    border protrusions after axis alignment, and (4) the output is the cropped rectangle but reflected along the axis\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:43:#    The two frame protrusion masks on opposite sides share one projected span, which keeps the scene tidy rather than\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/40/code.py:54:#    - `_frame_signature()` assumes each active side has exactly one contiguous span of protrusion positions with\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/bf45cf4b/D4/3/code.py:81:    - find_components(..., monochromatic=False) 仍然成立, 因为 control 虽变成双色, 但仍是单个前景连通块\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:3:# Name: 射线交汇终止+链式反应+开口相对配对\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:16:#     - 保留原题的半包围漏斗墙体与“由端点外推两条边界射线”这一几何核心，但场景改成\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:21:#     - 右精灵被触发后，以被击中的开口格为种子，向左反向辐射。它的两条边界射线与左\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:22:#       精灵早先射出的边界射线在中间走廊内相遇，于是后手射线在交点停下，先手射线也\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:24:#     - 对比原始任务：原题只处理一个墙体，且射线总到边界；本融合版必须同时追踪\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:25:#       “谁先启动、谁触发谁、第二次反向辐射在哪里撞上已有射线”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:30:#       关系可以由几何而非颜色值推断；同时随机化水平/垂直摆放、起手方向与 1:1/1:2 射线，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:33:#       与“射线到边界”的同输入输出必须不同，避免样例退化成原题或纯 D10。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/23/code.py:43:#       截断”的时序线索。此组合改为：射线状态会被截断，但已落下的早期填充不回滚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D3/4/code.py:3:# Change: 双色精灵：外层色（多数像素）包裹内层色（少数像素，可选），2x2到5x9尺寸，左右对称，在顶部区域互不重叠... → 分离式双组件精灵\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:3:# Name: 仅辐射+间歇涂色+粗射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:17:#     - 融合后的输出只在开口外出现一束直带：以 seed 的横向/纵向对齐位置为中心，沿开口方向发射固定 3 像素宽的射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:18:#     - 射线采用固定节律的虚线：深度 1、3、5... 的层保留填色，深度 2、4、6... 留成背景色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:19:#     - 障碍物保留原色，并按“通道阻断”处理：粗射线的 3 条并行通道分别独立前进，某一通道碰到障碍或墙后，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:28:#     - 射线宽度固定为 3，且 generator 会把 seed 放在至少 3 格宽的开口走廊上，使“粗射线”在多个样例中稳定可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:32:#     - 原 solver 的阴影扫描基于连续 filled_mask；这里改成逐通道直射，因此阻挡要在射线追踪时在线处理，而不能事后扫线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:33:#     - “粗射线宽度为 3” 隐含要求：seed 对齐的 3 条通道必须都能穿过开口。generator 通过选择具有 3 格净空走廊的 seed 保证这一点。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/b9e38dc0/22/code.py:37:#     - seed 仅放在局部 interior 中，且其所在列/行以及相邻两条并行通道从 seed 到开口全程无墙，保证 3 宽射线物理可通过。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/7b3084d4/14/code.py:62:#    staircase bites and protrusions, not as a single centered notch.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:12:#    vertical control edge, yet orientation is encoded by inward protrusion masks on the inner border line rather\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:18:#    component, test every dihedral transform, compare frame protrusion masks to object bg-hole masks on candidate\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:36:#    Frame protrusions live on row/col 1 or n-2, so all interior objects are placed with `border=2`. The true\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:44:#    To avoid clutter, inactive frame sides are blank, protrusions stay away from corners, the number of distractors\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:55:#   frame protrusion signatures.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:215:    - The frame has one horizontal and one vertical control side, each with an inward protrusion mask.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:216:    - Exactly one interior component has jagged guide edges whose bg-hole masks can align to those protrusions.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/fc7cae8d/10/code.py:379:        raise ValueError(\"frame too small for protrusion signatures\")\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/31/code.py:30:# - 虽然 D12 的原始含义要求重复的是同一个目标色，因此星形各射线在该一步会同色，但 D5 仍通过整条 trunk\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/31/code.py:39:# - `_bridge_cells()` 仍要求两个方块共享同一内带行或列。generator 必须把 star leaves 放在当前节点的清晰射线上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/31/code.py:43:# - 所有方块都放在规则格点上，trunk 是自避免路径，star leaves 只从某个 trunk 节点向空射线额外伸出。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/31/code.py:52:# - 只允许一个星形事件，且 leaf 位于彼此不同的水平/垂直射线上，避免桥梁互相盖住。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/3e6067c3/31/code.py:69:#   generator 只从 `_find_star_choices()` 返回的空射线上选 leaves。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D6/2/code.py:22:# - 输入仍是：顶部若干双色小精灵；底部 2-3 条全宽横条。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D6/2/code.py:38:# - 生成器强制每个样本至少有一个双色精灵，避免样本长期退化成纯色精灵，从而让 D6 不可见。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D6/2/code.py:56:# - 每个样本至少 1 个双色精灵；其洞在输出中必须落到某条内部，因此能看到“边框色轮廓 + 背景色洞”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/f931b4a8/30/code.py:3:# Name: 双色语义+遮罩填充+多色模板\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/8/code.py:8:#      ctrl 只在输出里沿自身行/列向内发射间歇射线; 分割线上的 fg 保持原位。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/8/code.py:27:#    - 原射线逻辑只依赖 split 线上的 fg 极值, 与片段翻转/贴边方式无关, 因而保持不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/8/code.py:39:#    - 颜色仍只有 bg/fg/ctrl 三类。split 线 fg 留在中心, 保留片段靠边, 射线只覆盖背景格, 图层关系清楚。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/33/code.py:75:    - ctrl 射线只在 split 行列上出现, 边缘块分散到外圈, 中心块集中在中区, 层次清晰。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D7/3/code.py:11:#   输入仍由顶部双色精灵 + 底部横条组成。外层颜色继续匹配某个条的填充色，\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/7c66cb00/D7/3/code.py:26:#   2. pattern 提取依赖顶部区域的非背景组件 bbox 可完整包住双色精灵；镜像只影响输出位置，因此成立。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/23/code.py:3:# Name: 45度转弯 + 直线射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a25697e4/25/code.py:7:#    - 原题: 输入里有边框框架和远处的双色工具; 输出把工具对接进框架, 保留框架, 输出尺寸不变。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a25697e4/25/code.py:31:#    - 颜色变化仍只发生在翻转情形且仅限双色工具, 颜色数少且有 plug/handle 分区结构支撑。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/32/code.py:30:#    - 只保留一个对象类型（中心空洞十字），输出只增加“规则化的矩形框 + 固定双色”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/da515329/32/code.py:34:#      容易显得杂乱。这里采用“按整圈交替”来落实 D14/2 的双色思想，让人更容易\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/37/code.py:3:# Name: 箭头指示方向+距离编码射线长度\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/37/code.py:31:    - each control is now a 3-cell L-shaped arrow touching exactly one border:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/37/code.py:104:  - All ctrl cells belong to 1 or 2 size-3 L-shaped arrow components.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/24/code.py:3:# Name: 双色系统分离\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/7/code.py:3:# Name: 射线碰撞停止+三控制像素\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/21897d95/3/code.py:3:# Name: L形射线寻源\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D2 — 射线发射点 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/0/code.py:3:# Change: 从外边框线段的两个端点发射，每条线段恰好发射2条射线... → 从线段每个像素发射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a25697e4/1/code.py:14:#      7-cell region stays outside as the protrusion. Reflection still triggers a color swap when\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/a25697e4/1/code.py:315:    - Rotate/flip the tool so the cavity-sized color region fills the notch, while the frame-matching color stays outside as the protrusion.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/35/code.py:17:      - ctrl 射线画法沿用原题: 从边界向内, 只在 bg 上涂 ctrl, 直到该行/列最远的 fg。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/4a21e3da/35/code.py:48:    - 中心目标按区分类投到内角或中心条带, 与 split-line fg 至少隔 1 格, 不会覆盖 ctrl 射线或静止 fg。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:2:# Dimension: D2 — 射线发射点 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:3:# Change: 从外边框线段的两个端点发射，每条线段恰好发射2条射线... → 仅从距菱形最远的端点发射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:7:#    原题里，每条外侧短对角线段都从两个端点各发 1 条外射线。D2 变体要把“发射点”\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:15:#    若变体输入使用前两格 [(-1,3),(0,4)]，原题输出会从两端都向 (-1,+1) 发射两条平行射线；\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:29:#    - 旧 generator 默认 output-first，但没要求 suppressed ray（被删掉的旧射线）必须为空。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:31:#      时必须同时为“保留的射线”和“被抑制的旧射线”预留空间。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:34:#    计算新规则射线和旧规则下的另一条 suppressed ray。搜索时禁止任何对象占用这些旧/新射线\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/1/code.py:41:#    保留原题棋盘背景、空心菱形和对角射线的整体视觉语言，只把外线段变短并偏置。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code_combo/bf45cf4b/26/code.py:69:      - 融合后 control 也变成双色, 该假设失效\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D2 — 射线发射点 (path)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D2/2/code.py:3:# Change: 从外边框线段的两个端点发射，每条线段恰好发射2条射线... → 从菱形顶点直接发射\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:2:# Dimension: D8 — 射线颜色来源 (trajectory)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:3:# Change: 射线颜色与对应的外边框线段颜色相同... → 射线颜色为菱形颜色\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:11:#     - 每条外线段仍从两个端点向外发射两条对角射线，直到边界或遇到非背景。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:13:#     - 原题: 射线用外线段颜色。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:14:#     - 本变体: 射线改用对应菱形颜色；外线段只负责提供位置与方向线索。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:18:#     - 原题输出会长出绿色射线；本变体输出会长出红色射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:19:#     - 所以 solver 不能再把“外线段组件的颜色”直接拿去涂射线，而要先确定该组件属于哪个菱形。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:22:#     - 为了让 D8 差异可观察，生成器强制保留可见射线，且外线段颜色来自非菱形色调板。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:24:#       但长出来的射线却统一回到内层菱形色”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:27:#     - `diamonds`: 仍按 8 连通 + 固定 8 像素形状识别，颜色是否会延伸到射线不影响输入识别，因为输入里没有射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:32:#     - `if int(out[rr, cc]) in bg_colors`: 仍安全，因为生成器保证射线路径不穿过其他非背景对象；不会要求“穿过同色射线继续画”。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:34:#     - 放置仍采用 output-first：先放菱形、线段和完整射线，再把射线抹回棋盘得到输入。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:35:#     - 候选放置要求菱形、线段、射线全都不重叠；这样 solver 在输入上能稳定恢复。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:36:#     - 生成器还要求总射线像素数达到下限，避免出现“看不到变体”的退化样本。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/80a900e0/D8/0/code.py:38:#     - 如果没有射线像素，或者外线段色恰好等于菱形色，人类无法确认 D8 已变化