me/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:15:#      变体：若 (2,3)=红色而 (4,3) 不是绿色，则只沿“向上”的垂直对角方向发射，即只出现 NE 射线。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:16:#      差异集中在“触发器收集 -> 射线方向决定”这一环节。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:25:#    - 原逻辑的“只填背景不覆盖非背景”仍然保留，因此生成器必须继续保证输入像素不落在任何应被填充的蓝线/射线路径上。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:28:#    - 红/绿指令像素必须避开：已有输入像素、已有输出填充区域、同段其他触发器的射线路径。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:29:#    - 射线路径也必须避开所有输入像素；这样输出只会往背景中补色，不会出现覆盖。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:31:#    - 人类可以直接看到：有些品红点上方有红点、下方有绿点，而输出中的品红射线也会相应少一侧或双侧。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:35:#    - 生成器拒绝任何会让指令像素落到蓝线填充区、已有射线或其他输入像素上的摆放。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:38:#    - 输出颜色仍只使用蓝色补线和品红射线，不引入新的输出颜色映射。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/db695cfb/D17/2/code.py:42:#    - solver 按行排序端点后提取一条 `ddr < 0` 的“向上”垂直射线和一条 `ddr > 0` 的“向下”垂直射线；生成器也始终以同一方向约定放置指令。\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:2:# Dimension: D14 — 边界突出（protrusion）的定义与处理 (multi_step)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:18:#    - The new object type is a one-cell attached protrusion at the boundary between the\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:34:#    - 3-6 protrusions are added per sample, enough to make boundary-triggered patches\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:36:#    - We restrict protrusions to region-region boundaries, not arbitrary background specks.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:43:#    - _dent_centers() only scans black cells, so protrusions would be invisible unless a new\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:45:#    - Starting output from the cleaned grid is still valid because protrusions should not\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:49:#    - Every dent/protrusion center is chosen with Chebyshev separation >= 3, so 3x3 stamps\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:51:#    - A protrusion candidate is accepted only if inserting that one cell and then applying\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:64:#    - Boundary protrusions are sparse and separated, so teal marks do not stack into messy\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:102:    Reconstruct the clean two-region baseline before applying dent/protrusion stamps.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:159:def _protrusion_centers(\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:194:    Convert dents and boundary protrusions into teal-centered 3x3 patches.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:199:      one-cell protrusions that cross from one foreground region into the other.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:206:    - Every original one-cell boundary protrusion that cleanup rewrites into the other\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:208:      the protrusion's source color as the patch color, and the trigger center is teal.\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:222:    protrusions = _protrusion_centers(g, clean, colors, bg)\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:229:    for r, c, stamp_color in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:232:    for r, c, _ in dents + protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:253:# --- CFG: protrusions ---\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:396:    protrusions: list[tuple[int, int, int]],\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:406:    for r, c, stamp_color in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:412:    for r, c, _ in protrusions:\n/home/lixinyu/snap/new/ceshi/code/de809cff/D14/2/code.py:443:def _neighbor_protrusion_safe(\n/home/lixinyu/